2 CONT ===Notes
2 CONT * Will of WILLIAM DALLATHY, GENT. OF BDOS
2 CONT * St. Michaels Parish, Barbados
2 CONT * 20 Nov 1677, RB6/10, P. 188
2 CONT * Dau Margrett Lewis, wf of Capt. Hugh Lewis;
2 CONT * Wife Elizabeth Dallathy ? Executrx;
2 CONT * gr chn Elizabeth, Margarett, William, John, & Benjamin, all at 18; Capt. John Farmer, Margarett Farmer, Samuell Farmer, & Elizabeth Farmer, the sons & daus of Samuel Farmer Esq of Bdos; James Cowes, gr ch of said Samuel.
2 CONT * Signed William Dallathy.
2 CONT * Wit: John Sparke, William (x) Lukus [or Curtis?], Susannah (x) Barnes
2 CONT * Proved 29 JUNE 1680, court says Hon. John Sparke is also decd.
2 CONT * (Barbados Records Wills and Administrations Volume 1, 2 and 3. Joanne McRee Sanders.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT In January 1679, Mr William Dallathy had one horse (as did most, a few had 2) in Major John ffarmer?s Troop of horse belonging to the Leward Regiment commanded by the Honble Coll. Symon Lambart, dec?d
2 CONT ---
2 CONT Strangely, I can find no reference other people ever called Dallathy, other than William and his daughter Margaret who married Hugh ap Lewis.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1: Elizabeth; Marriage 3: 2 Elizabeth Palt, 1660 at St Leonard’s Shoreditch 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT #Has Children Elizabeth Dallathy married Hugh ap Lewis 
2 CONT #Has Children Margaret Dallathy b: 1653 in England married Samuel Farmer 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
