2 CONC raham II] was born March 12, 1700, married about 1723 '''Martha (or Hannah) Davis, daughter of Nathaniel Davis''', a Quaker from Devonshire, England.  He owned much land in Hanover, Louisa and Goochland counties.  He was justice o
2 CONC f the peace for Hanover county and one of the first justices of the ...
