2 CONC -186):  Abraham Venable, II., born in New Kent County Va, March 22, 1700; died in Louisa County, December 16, 1768; married, in Hanover County, 1723, Martha Davis, an earnest Quakeress, born July 14, 1702; died Feb 18, 1765.  They
2 CONC  had ten children; the fifth child, Nathaniel Venable, above; sixth child, James Venable, b. 1734, in Hanover...
