1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Lyon-116
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 15 Jun 2020 | Created 21 Dec 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT =Mary (Lyon) Bailey (1744 - 1787)=
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Bailey formerly Lyon
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1744 in Albemarle County, Virginia Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Elisha Lyon and Phoebe (Nix) Lyon
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of John Lyon, Edward Lyons and Guthridge Lyons
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Bailey — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Elisha Bailey and Elishah Bailey
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 1787 in Albemarle County, Virginia, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Created through import of Yates and Allied Families.ged on 21 December 2010.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Virginia Bailey Genealogy [1] reviews research of Bailey in Albemarle Co., including John Bailey married to Frances Lyon. The following comment was made about a (so far) unrelated Elisha Bailey married to another Lyon.
2 CONT
2 CONT "If the said Elisha Bailey, grandson of Elisha Lyon, was a child at the time his maternal grandfather made this gift, he, very probably was the Elisha Bailey who, in Albemarle County, married Hannah Gay, 'spinster,' December 11, 1
2 CONC 783. (40)."
2 CONT
2 CONT The above statement eliminates Elisha Bailey's mother Mary Lyon from being married to the John Bailey, a primary subject of the book, and known to be married to Frances Lyon.
2 CONT
2 CONT The two John Baileys (John Bailey-468 and John Bailey-3047) were merged 11 Aug 2012 - with the poor consequence of making both Frances and Mary his wife. I did not find evidence of Elisha son of Mary having a sister Elisabeth and 
2 CONC particularly didn't find reason for her to be also named Turner. I constructed a New John Bailey, married to Mary, and with son Elisha. I'll do what I can in the reconstruction. (Cecil Stuerke)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ The Virginia Bailey Genealogy by Robert Gresham Bailey page 21, 1947
2 CONT Source: #S-996183581 Page: Ancestry Family Trees Text: http://trees.ancestry.com/pt/AMTCitationRedir.aspx?tid=174432&pid=-2114897263 Source S-996183581 Repository: #R-2009299244 Title: Ancestry Family Trees Repository R-2009299244
2 CONC  Frances was born about 1744. She passed away in 1787.
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances Mary Lyon, daughter of Elishah (if there was one) was not the spouse of John Bailey. Frances Lyon, daughter of John Lyon (who died 1784) was the spouse of John Bailey. John Bailey had a son Elisha, but perhaps the son shou
2 CONC ld be kept with this profile till it can be properly fitted.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ID: I386878 Name: Mary LYON Given Name: Mary Surname: Lyon Sex: F Birth: ABT 1744 in Albemarle Co,VA Death: 1767/1771 in Albemarle Co,VA Note: Mary LYON Sex: F Birth: ABT 1744 in Virginia Death: BET. 1765 - 1771 in Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 John BAILEY b: ABT 1740 in Virginia Married: ABT 1762 in Albermarle co, Virginia Children Elisha BAILEY b: 20 NOV 1763 in Albermarle co, Virginia Elizabeth BAILEY b: ABT 1765 in Albermarle county, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT I hate errors, so please inform me of any so I may correct them, this work is best I could do as of Nov 2006 and is all I have in general. Please use with caution. jhll
2 CONT
