2 CONT
2 CONT When Reuben C. Nix was born about 1808, in Harris, Georgia, United States, his father, James Nix, was 50 and his mother, Elizabeth Albritton, was 43. He married Amerilious Williams on 11 November 1832, in Harris, Georgia, United S
2 CONC tates. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 6 daughters. He died about 1845, at the age of 37.
