1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Frances Venables''' was born after 1596 in Cholmondeley, Cheshire, England (United Kingdom). Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-93792025 Sir Hugh Cholmondelay, the Younger] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-11270170
2 CONC 6 Mary Cholmondeley]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the sister of Sir Robert Cholmondeley, Bart, Earl of Leinster
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances married [https://www.geni.com/profile-1167157 Baron Peter Venables, MP, of Kinderton]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34640782668 George Venables];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715859385 William Venables];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715859358 Frances Venables];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-1167123 Thomas Venables];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648648270 Anne Fowler];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715859297 Robert Venables];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-67154802 William Venables]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1643 in Cholmondeley, Cheshire, England (United Kingdom). 
2 CONT ----
