1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1827 William Venable was a lucky drawer in the land lottery of 1827.
2 CONT
2 CONT Walton Co. Ga. May 16, 1827 William sold a tract of 300 acres to Jacob & John Hymer for $1000.00.
2 CONT
2 CONT Recorded Book B Page 91 Oct. 3, 1827
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Co., GA. December 5, 1827 William purchased 202 & 1/2 acres from Benjamin Manes (?) for
2 CONT
2 CONT $300.00. District 6 Lot 195 recorded 12/12/1827 Book B Page 399
2 CONT
2 CONT Witness H Burges ?
2 CONT
2 CONT Green B Turner J.P.
2 CONT
2 CONT Coweta Co., GA. February 25, 1831 William purchased 106 acres known as lot 6 in the 5th district
2 CONT
2 CONT from George Scott for $125.00
2 CONT
2 CONT Coweta Co., Ga. June 18, 1833 William sold 106 acres, lot 6 5th district to Jacob D Abraham for
2 CONT
2 CONT the sum of $150.00 recorded the 19 June, 1833
2 CONT
