2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth MEREDITH was born about 1710 in Hanover County, Virginia. (216) She was married to John COLLIER Jr. in 1739 in Hanover County, Virginia.(60) Children were: Thomas COLLIER, Sally COLLIER, John COLLIER Sr., Elizabeth Ironm
2 CONC onger COLLIER, Frances COLLIER , Joseph COLLIER, Anne COLLIER , William COLYER Sr., Mary COLLIER, Charles COLLIER, James COLLIER, Richard COLLIER.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Disambiguation 
2 CONT
2 CONT Some sources (including the one listed below) claim that this John Collier died in Augusta County, VA. This is incorrect. It was a different John Collier that was living in Augusta County.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
