1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah (Randel) Nix - birth 20 Dec 1763 recorded at Bush River MM, Union County, SC. daughter of Joseph Randel. Sarah's birth was at Western Branch MM, Southampton County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Deed to Joseph Randel - 145 acres from John Nix - 10 Apr 1802 Franklin County, Georgia.
2 CONT
2 CONT RANDALL, Joseph - Will dated 26  May 1817 / Will recorded 4 Sep 1826 Miami County, Ohio / "money due me from South Carolina" (from land sold in Franklin County, Georgia) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Sarah Winters, dau of Moses Winters was in Cumberland County, Tennessee in 1780 - Moses Winters has no connection in SC. Sarah Winters married unknown NICKS in Cumberland County, Tennessee.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Historical Sketches of the Winters family, pioneer settlers of Middle Tennessee" , Ralph L. Winters: Moses Winters and his family moved in 1775 from Wyette County, VA to Carters Valley in upper East Tennessee
