1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not named in the 1784 Will of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Garrett-IV/6000000001322314562?through=2349054
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth  was born abt 1723 at Stokes, North Carolina. She died about 1807 at Stokes, NC
2 CONT
2 CONT Her parents are seen as John Garrett (1706-1784) and Martha Frances "Patsy" Scott (1716-1788) without supporting evidence.  She is also seen as Elizabeth Frances Garrett Born: 1732 in Goochland, Goochland, Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT #  abt 1744 at Hanover, Virginia to Valentine Gibson who died abt 1800 at Stokes, North Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT Childen
2 CONT * 1. John Gibson, b. abt 1750 at Hanover, VA; d. before 28 Dec 1839 at Cumberland, KY
2 CONT * 2. Garrett Gibson, b. 1752 at Stokes, NC; d. 1809 at Jefferson City, TN; in 1779 he married Prudence Sumner or Sommers (b. 1760) at Surry, NC.
2 CONT * 3. James Thomas Gibson - b. abt 1754, see below for more information about his family
2 CONT * 4. Valentine Gibson, b. abt 1756
2 CONT * 5. Archeleus Gibson, b. abt 1763; d. Feb 1807 at Grainger, TN; he married twice - to Sarah Sumner and Jamina Miney
2 CONT * 6. Jeremiah?
2 CONT * 7. Ezekial?
2 CONT * 5. Hannah Gibson, b. 9 Oct 1764, d. Dec 1841. On 23 Jan 1782 she married Samuel Jackson (1758-1834)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants of Valentine GIBSON
