2 CONT
2 CONT More About VALENTINE GIBSON and ELIZABETH UNKNOWN:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: ABT 1744, North Carolina?
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of VALENTINE GIBSON and ELIZABETH UNKNOWN are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. i. GARRETT2 GIBSON, b. 1752, , Stokes, North Carolina; d. ABT 1809, , Jefferson, Tennessee.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. ii. JAMES SR GIBSON, b. 1750, , Stoke, North Carolina; d. ABT 1820, , Knox, Kentucky.
2 CONT
