2 CONT Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Herring-3512
2 CONT
2 CONT Whether https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-Herring/6000000003615380251?through=6000000195478563830 had a daughter named Margaret who married Thomas Doss remains unproven. She was not mentioned in Alexander's will. All we know i
2 CONC s that Thomas and Margaret Doss were paid to testify in Essex court between 1725-1729. In addition, Alexander's daughter Sarah cannot be the one who married Jno Doss in 1735.[2]
2 CONT
