2 CONT When Amerilious Williams was born in January 1818, in Anson, North Carolina, United States, her father, William Bennett Williams, was 35 and her mother, Frances Fanny Ricketts, was 28. She married Reuben C. Nix on 11 November 1832
2 CONC , in Harris, Georgia, United States. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 6 daughters. She lived in Smith Township, Dallas, Arkansas, United States for about 10 years. She died in 1906, in Chilton, Alabama, United States, 
2 CONC at the age of 88.
