2 CONT *She married Sir Richard Grosvenor, 1st Bt., son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Richard-Grosvenor/6000000001472441805 Richard Grosvenor] and Christian Brooke. 
2 CONT *She died circa 17 January 1611/12. 
2 CONT *She was buried on 20 January 1611/12.3
