1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Barret (b. Abt. 1660, d. Aft. 1702)
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Barret was born Abt. 1660 in England, and died Aft. 1702 in Hunterdon County, New Jersey. She married (1) Andrew Heath, son of Roger Heath and Jane Silox. She married (2) William Venables. She married (3) Lawrence Bannor
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Barret and Andrew Heath are: +Elizabeth Heath, b. 1688, Amwell Township, Hunterdon County, New Jersey, d. date unknown, Hunterdon County, New Jersey. Andrew Heath, d. date unknown. John Heath, d. date unknown
2 CONC . Sarah Heath, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Barret and William Venables are: Frances Venables, d. date unknown. Joyce Venables, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Barret and Lawrence Bannor are: Lawrence Bannor, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
