2 CONT Davis line goes to New Kent NA kit numbers who lines go to Malungeon Town, TN 
2 CONT . Listed as Direct ancestors of President Obama , Johnny Depp, and Nathaniel Robert Davis line of Jefferson Davis CSA President  though disavowed as such by Davis researchers in their 1800 writings (which is not surprising).  For 
2 CONC the famous relatives, see http://fabpedigree.com/s047/f020525.htm which has a disclaimer that this may be a made up line; but, they also have left out Nectowerance, brother of Totopotomoi who was not Toby West--as Toby was not ill
2 CONC iterate, signed as "King of Pamunky", is tied in patents on the Discussion tab of Cockacoeske as a De La Warr West with no known descendants who owned land in different locations than the Chief listed in an 1847 book cited by Prof
2 CONC essor Rountree book.  
2 CONT
2 CONT For the Jefferson Davis via Nathaniel Davis direct to Niketti, see Source tab as the most compelling is the Hughes/Davis/Burnett/Bolling of Craven Co, NC  history to Malungo Town to Newman's Ridge( per the SNP Group in FTDNA Pedig
2 CONC ree labeled their direct descent from Toby West (sic) -- FTDNA admin page says there is a sirname mistake, that  none of the Wests in group 7 are kin to each other, paternally.
2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Nicketti is  listed in a 1847 book addressed later by Dr. Roundtree & mentioned  Ancestry Messages. states that  Nicketti, was a sister to Totopotomoi and as children of the Chief of Pamunkey named NECTO became the Chief 
2 CONC of the Pamunky after Opecancanough was killed. She can not be the daughter of Opitchapum because he died in 1630. 
