2 CONT '''Abadiah Floyd''' was born before 1730 in Accomac, Virginia. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-8560868 Robert Davis] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-8560883 Abadieh Davis (Lewis)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abadiah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-104598614 Col. William Floyd] circa 1746 in Amherst County, Province of Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-104804878 Sarah Powell (Floyd)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34645176268 Isham Floyd]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-115929829 Elizabeth Tuley (Floyd)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-26225000 James John Floyd]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-33549256 Maj. Robert Clark Floyd]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34645222845 Jemima Sturgis (Floyd)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34645224678 Nancy Pryor (Floyd)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34645225168 Charles Floyd]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34645237109 Nathaniel Floyd]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34645241406 Abigail Alexander]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-33549393 Abadiah Floyd]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34686815809 John Floyd]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1824 in Charles Floyd&#39;s home, Beargrass Creek, Near Louisville, Jefferson County, Kentucky, United States. 
2 CONT ----
