1 NOTE {geni:about_me} the will of Robert Davis names his nine children. Three of them are sons by his last wife (Grace) who lived with them in Natchez. The other six were grown children living back in Virginia and/or Kentucky. Three of 
2 CONC the six were married daughters, and Robert Davis thought it important enough to mention them all in his will, even though he had moved away from them before 1759. 
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT
