2 CONT *http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nelson_County,_Virginia
2 CONT *http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amherst_County,_Virginia
2 CONT * https://freepages.rootsweb.com/~harrisonrep/genealogy/Harrison/d0075/g0000067.html#I12348
