1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Often confused with her sister https://www.geni.com/people/Ann-Michaux/6000000183909510933?through=6000000002228250950 but they are both named in their father's will:
2 CONT
2 CONT I give to my three '''eldest daughters Anne''', Jane Magdalin and Susanna three hundred Acres of the aforesaid Land to be laid off at the lower end and equally divided between them to have and to hold to them and their heirs forev
2 CONC er. 
2 CONT
2 CONT to my three '''youngest Daughters''' Elizabeth, '''Annmadlin''' and Ester Mary to them and their heirs forever. 
