2 CONT Judith Woodson's https://www.geni.com/people/Judith-Michaux/377597907280006920?through=6000000004169842647 brother.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT "Anne lived to a great age, but was survived by only two daughters, Agnes and Elizabeth."
