1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Poplar Hill Plantation was built by Richard Woodson in Farmville, Virginia. It was handed down to his daughter Agnes and her husband Francis Watkins. The Poplar Hill Plantation now houses the Poplar Hill Golf Club.
