2 CONT Anne Mayo Venable Read BIRTH	4 Jun 1784 Prince Edward County, Virginia, USA DEATH	27 Feb 1869 (aged 84) Charlotte County, Virginia, USA BURIAL	Unknown  MEMORIAL ID	77024283 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 1 FLOWERS 1 Anne was born at "Springfield" Prince Edward, County, VA. In 1802 she married Isaac Read, Jr (b.1777 Charlotte County d. 1823 at "Sweetsprings"). He was the son of Col. Isaac Read (Revolutionary War) wh
2 CONC o died 7/7/1777 and Sara Embra who died in 1802. Anne & Issac Jr. lived at "Greenfield" plantation Charlotte County, VA. The plantation passed into her control after the death of her husband. Their children not shown below were: S
2 CONC amuel Venable Read (died in college), Isaac Read III, Anne Cabell Read (died young).
2 CONT
