2 CONT Withers2 King (276) was born on 20 Aug 1741 at Brooke, Overwharton Parish, Stafford Co., Virginia.  He married Sarah Harrison (293), daughter of Cuthbert Harrison (294) and Frances Osborne Barnes (295), in 1762 at Stafford Co., Va
2 CONC .  He ended military service on 15 Oct 1779 at Jefferson Co., Kentucky.  He died in 1818 at Nelson Co., Kentucky.  He left a will in 1818 at Nelson Co., Ky.
