1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/150731358/judith-anthony
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Judith Moorman (daughter of Charles Moorman and Mary Adams) was born June 26, 1748, and died Abt. 1775.She married Christopher Anthony, son of Joseph Anthony, Sr. and Elizabeth Clark.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links==
