2 CONT The daughter of Charles & Mary Anne (Adams) Moorman of Louisa Co VA, Judith married Christopher Anthony in 1765 at Cedar Creek Quaker Friends MH in Hanover Co VA, the son of Lieutenant Joseph & Elizabeth (Clark) Anthony of Henrico
2 CONC  Co VA.  They had four children, two sons and 2 daughters, before Judith died less than 6 months shy of 25 yrs.
2 CONT
