1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HE WAS THE S/O NICHOLAS WHITE (WHO WAS THE S/O RICHARD WHITE) AND MARTHA REESE. HIS SIBLINGS WERE SOLOMON, MARY, PALATERE, REBECCA, SUCKA, AN UNKNOWN DAUGHTER THAT MARRIED A NIX BECAUSE IN NICHOLAS WHITES WILL HER 
2 CONC TWO CHILDREN BARBARY NIX FOWLER AND JOHN NIX WERE MENTIONED IN HIS WILL. THE LAST CHILD IN THE WILL WAS BARBARA WHITE RAINS. HIS FATHER NICHOLAS WAS A REVOLUTIONARY WAR SOLDIER AND HIS MUSKET BELONGS TO THE DECENDENTS OF TERRELL W
2 CONC HITE. THE YOUNGEST SON IN EACH GENERATION INHERITED THE GUN. TERRELL WAS THE YOUNGEST SON AND CHILD OF ANDERSON. NICHOLAS WHITE ALSO HAD A 2ND WIFE, HER NAME IS NOT KNOWN, SOME RESEARCHERS THINK IT WAS ELIZABETH MUSKOGEE. IT WAS S
2 CONC AID THAT SHE WAS AN INDIAN. BECAUSE NICHOLAS'S YOUNGEST CHILD BARBARA WHITE RAINS GRAVE WAS MOVED TO REST BESIDE HER HUSBAND DABNEY RAINS. HE HAD DIED JUST BEFORE THE CIVIL WAR AND SHE DIED IN 1873. WHEN BARBARA DIED SHE COULD NOT
2 CONC  BE BURIED BESIDE HIM BECAUSE OF A LARGE ROCK. LATER SHE WAS LAID TO REST BESIDE DABNEY. WHEN HER BODY WAS DUG UP IT WAS SAID SHE HAD LONG STRAIGHT HAIR AND WAS TALL AND HAD THE FEATURES AND A DARKER COMPLEXION OF AN INDIAN.
2 CONT
2 CONT ANDERSON WHITE MARRIED MARGERY PULLIUM 28 FEB. 1786 IN CAMPBELL CO VA. THEY WERE THE PARENTS OF AT LEAST 11 CHILDREN. THE FIRST 6 WERE BORN IN VA. NICHOLAS, MARTHA R., ISHAM, AGNES, JOHN, AND NANCY. THE LAST 5 WERE BORN IN ELBERT 
2 CONC CO. GA. ANDERSON JR., DAVID, ABDA, ELIZABETH AND TERRELL. HIS GRAVE IS MARKED WITH INITIALS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT THE PHOTOS ON THIS SITE ARE PICTURES OF ANDERSON AND MARGERY PULLIUM WHITE'S SONS ABDA WITH HIS WIFE MARY ANN BRADBERRY AND THEIR YOUNGEST CHILD TERRELL WHITE.
2 CONT
2 CONT PLEASE CLICK ON THE PHOTOS TO MAKE THEM LARGER. THE MONUMENT LISTED TELLS WHY THE GRAVES WERE MOVED FROM LAKE ERMA IN HENRY CO TO THE NEW CEMETERY. THE GRAVES WERE NOT PHYSICALLY REMOVED. A LITTLE DIRT FROM EACH GRAVE SITE WAS MOV
2 CONC ED TO THE NEW CEMETERY.
2 CONT
2 CONT FOR MORE INFORMATION ON ALL THE PEOPLE BURIED IN THE WHITE FOSTER FAMILY CEMETERY GO TO HAISTEN AT EAST LAWN MEMORIAL PARK, MCDONOUGH, HENRY CO. GA.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=68415493
