1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth:  1782 Lincoln County Kentucky, USA  Death:  1833 Garrard County Kentucky, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander died in the summer of 1833 from cholera.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 27 September 1809 in Garrard County Mary "Polly" (nee Stone) Mounce daughter of Spencer and Sarah (nee Smith) Stone and widow of Henry Mounce/Mounts. They had the following children: Theresa Collier Mariah Alexander Col
2 CONC lier Aaron Collier Moses Collier Catherine "Kitty" Ann Collier Matilda Harris Collier James Monroe Collier
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander, Jr., seems to have been the "black sheep" of the family. By a deed dated 12 March 1814 Aaron Collier sold 3 acres. The grantees on this deed were Theresa Collier, age 3 years, and Mariah Alexander Collier age 1. On 1 Ju
2 CONC ne 1830 Jacob F. and Sarah R. Collier sold 22 acres and the deed lists the grantees as Alexander Collier and all seven of his children.
2 CONT
