2 CONT To have and to hold the said land and granted premises together with all the appurtenances, hereditaments, woods, ways, waters, mines, minerals to the said Jos. WASHINGTON his heirs and assigns forever also all the estate, rights,
2 CONC  title, property, claim & demands which I the said Moses WINTERS now has or even had of in and to the said land & premises or any part or parcel thereof and I the said Moses WINTERS doth hereby covenant and agree for myself, my he
2 CONC irs, executors and administrator to and with the said Joseph WASHINGTON, his heirs and assigns that I the said Moses WINTERS my heirs, executors, administrators shall and will warrant and forever defend against all lawful claims o
2 CONC r demands of all person or persons whatsoever claiming or demanding the said 204 acres of land whereby the premises may be affected or incumbered contrary to the true intent and meaning of these presents for value rec'd.
2 CONT
2 CONT In witness whereof I have hereunto set my hand and affixed my seal the day and date above written.
