1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Elizabeth Alexander Allen (1819 - 1869)''', daughter of Jonathan Alexander and Tabitha Nix, was born 1 March 1819 at Union District, Union County, South Carolina. She died at the age of 50 on 23 May 1869 at West
2 CONC point, Clark County, Nevada, and was buried at Westpoint Cemetery, Moapa. She married '''Lewis Allen (1813 - 1888)''' on 6 September 1836 at Far West, Caldwell County, Missouri. She and her husband and children emigrated to Utah i
2 CONC n 1862.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Marriage and Children==
2 CONT Lewis Allen married Elizabeth Alexander. They had thirteen children, eleven of which survived to adulthood:
2 CONT # Tabitha Jane Allen (born 7 October 1838 Far West, Caldwell County, Missouri) married 1868 Woodruff Freeman
2 CONT # Beulah Ann Allen (born 24 May 1840 Calloway County, Kentucky) married 1868 Willis Webb
2 CONT # George William Allen (born 12 September 1842 - died in infancy)
2 CONT # Rial Allen (born 27 February 1844 Henry County, Tennessee) married 1868 Susan Collins
2 CONT # Jonathan Alexander Allen (born 30 January 1846 Calloway County, Kentucky) married 1881 Jane Nelson
2 CONT # Samuel Allen (17 January 1848 – 23 January 1848 Platte Township, Andrew County, Missouri)
2 CONT # James Byrd Allen (born 16 August 1850 Platte Township, Andrew County, Missouri) married Maria West
2 CONT # Margaret Elizabeth Allen (born 20 Janaury 1852 Platte Township, Andrew County, Missouri) married 1870 Brigham Young Baird
2 CONT # Sarah Melissa Allen (born 30 May 1854) married 1871 Daniel Vester Leroy
2 CONT # Andrew Jackson Allen (born 20 December 1856 Platte Township, Andrew County, Missouri) married Sariah E. Pulsipher
2 CONT # Martha Permilla Allen (born 9 December 1858 Platte Township, Andrew County, Missouri – 16 February 1931 Huntington, Emery County, Utah)  married William Marshall
2 CONT # Nancy Esther Allen (born 11 April 1861 Platte Township, Andrew County, Missouri) married Isaac E. Black
2 CONT # Mary Ellen Allen (born 1 April 1866 Washington, Washington County, Utah ) married 1883 Albert Allen
2 CONT
