2 CONT
2 CONT Alabama
2 CONT Walker County—Seven Sons of William B. McGough and Welthy Ann Nix
2 CONT
2 CONT Seven of the thirteen son of William B. McGough and Welthy Ann Nix served in the military in the Civil War, three in Union units, and four in Confederate units. This family receives special treatment on this page. In this section,
2 CONC  I list the sons according to age. Below this section is an alphabetical list of all Alabama soldiers.
2 CONT
2 CONT 'McGough, McGeough, and McGue Soldiers in U.S. Civil War, 1861–1865', by Hugh McGough, http://magoo.com/hugh/civilwar.html
2 CONT
