1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Newton McGough is the 11th of 13 sons born to Welthy Ann NIX and William B. McGOUGH.
2 CONT In Walker County, Alabama on February 12, 1885 Newton married Sarah A. JOHNSON, daughter of M J & Nancy C. Johnson.
2 CONT Newton was a coal miner near McGough Holler.
2 CONT According to his family, Newton is buried in an un-marked grave at Flatwoods Cemetery, Nauvoo, Walker Co AL.
