1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Hooper was born in 1744 in Hanover, Lunenburg, Virginia. Colony, the daughter of Obediah Hooper and Massilva Brooks .
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Hooper-957
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married William White about 1760 in Virginia, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT William and Mary had 8 known children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Phoebe Carter White 1761–1830
2 CONT # Mary Polly White 1763–
2 CONT # Betsy G White 1765–1845
2 CONT # Zachariah White 1770–
2 CONT # Thomas White 1773–1843
2 CONT # Nancy White 1775–1851
2 CONT # William White Jr 1776–1875
2 CONT # Richard White 1778–1860
2 CONT
2 CONT Inheritance Aug 1804 • Franklin, Georgia, USA --Mary inherits from her father Obediah Hooper one Negro boy named Bob.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inheritance Nov 1818 • Franklin, Georgia, USA -- She inherits from her husband William for use during her natural life for her support the whole of his estate both real and personal. She also inherits one Negro girl named Dilry to
2 CONC  dispose of as she pleases.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary is enumerated in the 1830 census as residing in Franklin County, Georgia, USA. The household is comprised of 1 male 15-19 yrs old, 1 male 20-29 yrs old, 1female under 5 yrs old, 1 female 20-29 yrs old, and 1 female 70-79 yrs 
2 CONC old.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary is found residing in Franklin County, Georgia, in 1832 in the Georgia Property Tax Digest. She is in Capt White's district (most likely her son)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary died 1849 in Clarke, Georgia, USA
2 CONT
