1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Amelia was born about 1760. She is head of household in the 1830 Barren Co., Kentucky census. She does not appear in the 1840 census. She likely died between the 1830 and 1840 censuses. No court records documenting
2 CONC  her death have been found. After her husband Johnson's death in 1829 their property was deeded to their son James. All of James' siblings signed off on the deed. Amelia is likely buried on this property in the northwest corner of
2 CONC  Barren Co., Kentucky
2 CONT
