2 CONC  died in England then? Source: List of Americans Confined in Mill-Prison, in England, since the Commencement of the Present War Date: Saturday, June 22, 1782 Paper: Pennsylvania Packet (Philadelphia, Pennsylvania) Volume: XI Issue
2 CONC : 901 Page: 2 Piece: Two of Two. Read less
