1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/13848475/john-gibson
2 CONT
2 CONT This is the "old" John Gibson, of whom one wife was Sinai. Believed to be father of William Daniel Gibson, Isom Gibson, John, Shadrack Jacob Gibson, Matilda Gibson Mankins, Mary Gibson Roberts, Drushane Gibson Hobbs, Mahala Gibson
2 CONC  Ruckman,and Lucinda Gibson Burnes. The relationship of Shadrack to this family is not proven, but some Benton Co. records seem to indicate that he is a son to John, and brother of William,Isom & John.
2 CONT
