1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Prudence Sumner was born 10 Mar 1760 in , Rowan, North Carolina, USA, and died 28 Sep 1835 in , Delaware, Indiana, USA. She was buried in Rees Cemetery, Delaware, Indiana. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Robert Sumner and Phebe Ann Beals.
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=:3072765&id=I527555640
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Garrett GIBSON Abt 1779 in Surry, NC. He was born 1752 in Stokes Co., NC, and died 1809 in TN.
2 CONT  	  Children of Prudence SUMNER and Garrett GIBSON are:
2 CONT * 	2	  i.	William GIBSON was born Abt 1779 in North Carolina, and died 23 Sep 1853 in Delaware Co., IN.
2 CONT * 	3	  ii.	Amelia GIBSON was born 6 Jun 1786 in Surry, NC.
2 CONT *	4	  iii.	Garrett GIBSON was born 1787, and died 29 Sep 1870 in Delaware Co., IN.
2 CONT *	5	  iv.	Anna GIBSON was born 1788 in Jefferson Co., TN.
2 CONT *+	6	  v.	Valentine GIBSON was born 24 Dec 1789 in Surry, NC, and died 7 Apr 1845 in Muncie, Delaware Co., IN.
2 CONT * 	7	  vi.	Borter GIBSON was born 9 Nov 1793 in Stokes Co., NC.
2 CONT
