1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/60778576/person/42373548731 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 28 2017, 0:12:06 UTC''
