1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Isaac Jackson was born in 1787 at Westfield, Surry County (later Stokes), North Carolina, his father, Samuel Jackson Jr. was 29, and his mother, Hannah Gibson, was 23. He married Nancy Sizemore 10 DEC 1808, (M
2 CONC arriage bond at Stokes County NC, bondsman: Thomas Bennett)  and they had one known son together. She died 1833 or before.  Isaac married Jemima Luce in 1833 in Indiana, and they had seven children together. He died before July 18
2 CONC 54 in Delaware County, Indiana.  His widow Jemima died after 1870 in Fayette County, Illinois.
2 CONT
