1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1860 Census:
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT Lemon, Cobb County, Georgia.  Head of household is his mother, Susan Agnew, age 32.  She is listed as a farmer.  Others in the household are E. T., age 19, E. J., age 17, D. H., age 15, W. C., age 13, G. M., age 11.  Ludlow is lis
2 CONC ted as L. P., age 4.  All are boys, except E. J.  All, including Susan, are listed as born in South Carolina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT 1870 Census:
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT Ray Dist., Hart County, Georgia.  William G. (or C.) is head of household, and 21 years old.  He is married to Mary J., who is 19 years old and was born in Georgia.  They have a son, age 2, William L.  William G.'s brother, George
2 CONC  M. is 20 years old and living with them.
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT Hartwell Dist., Hart County, Georgia.  Daniel H. Agnew is 25, and a farmer living with his wife, Rebecca A., age 28..  George W., son, age 9, and Nancy, daughter, age 2, and Edgar H., ? months.  All were born in Georgia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1880 Census:
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT Hall's District, Hart County, Georgia.  Married to Martha C. (age 24, born in Georgia, and both of her parents also born in Georgia), according to 1880 census.  He was listed in that census as P. L. Agnew (age 24).  Also in the ho
2 CONC usehold were son Judge Addison Agnew, (age 4) daughter Ida Agnew (age 2), and mother, Susan Agnew (age 57).  Judge and Ida were both listed as born in Georgia.  
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT 1900 Census:
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT Shelby County, Texas.  Lists Ludlow as Luds, born November, 1854, in South Carolina.  Wife is Samantha, born October, 1854, born in Georgia.  Daughter Mattie, born April, 1883, in Georgia.  Son George, born February, 1886, in Geor
2 CONC gia.  Daughter Sadie, born October, 1887, in Alabama.  Son Fletcher, born December, 1890, in Alabama.  Daughter Pearl, born January, 1894, in Texas.  And son, Eugene, born October, 1897, in Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT 1910 Census:
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT Shelby County, Texas.  Lud P. Agnew is listed as head of household.  His wife is listed as Samantha Agnew, age  55 (or it may be 35).  Both Ludlow and Samantha as listed as born in Georgia.  Also in the home were Ludlow's mother, 
2 CONC Susan, listed as age 80; Fletcher H. Agnew, son, age 28, Pearlie, daughter, age 14, Eugene, son, age 12, and Otha Conway, grandson, age 5.  Fletcher is listed as born in Alabama, with the other minors born in Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>
2 CONT
2 CONT First wife, Samantha, died in November, 1910.  In 1920 census, second wife, Frances, and Ludlow had three children, the oldest Ila Mae, 7.  It seems likely Ludlow and Frances were married between 1911 and 1913.
