2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT "Family Tradition says there were three Patty Brothers who came from England into New England at an early day. Two of them remained there, the other going either to North or So. Carolina, It was from the brother who went into CAro
2 CONC lina that our line of Pattys is descended. "
2 CONT
2 CONT Patty family history Document 
