2 CONT James Patty was the son of James Patty and Sarah Clanton and the husband of Margaret Mote. James' parents were not of the Quaker faith. However, when he married Margaret Mote James (Jr) converted to the Society of Friends principl
2 CONC es. James died in South Carolina and his will was probated 28 July 1796. His gravestone is missing.
