1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When John O. Paty was born on 20 November 1809, in Bluff Creek, Smith, Tennessee, United States, his father, Jesse F. Patty or Paty II, was 32 and his mother, Elizabeth 'Betsy' Whitley, was 20. He married Mildred "
2 CONC Millie" Boze in 1831, in Smith, Tennessee, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 8 daughters. He lived in Smith, Tennessee, United States for about 10 years and Tennessee, United States in 1870. He died on 22
2 CONC  July 1889, in Woodside, Oregon, Missouri, United States, at the age of 79, and was buried in Hickory Grove Cemetery, Woodside Township, Oregon, Missouri, United States.
