1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Warning''' There were several Littleberry Vest in the Vest lineage! Read a research paper written by a Vest family member. There may have been six different men named Littleberry! https://www.geni.com/documents/
2 CONC view?doc_id=6000000185003815857
2 CONT
2 CONT Best way to keep them separated is the area they settled in and possibly by their wife's names and  their father's names. 
2 CONT
2 CONT This Littleberry  Vest settled in Franklin County, Missouri along with many extended family members as well as his sister, https://www.geni.com/profile/index/6000000176120131833. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
