1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Priscilla Bingham''' was born in 1770 in Hannover County, VA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34778356830 Charles Vest, of Hannover County] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34778356920 Sarah Vest]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Priscilla married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746310018 Josiah Bingham]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746309017 Wyatt Bingham]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa December 1851 in Arrow Rock, Saline Co., Missouri. 
