2 CONC 36   Birth Year: abt 1824   Birthplace: Alabama   Home in 1860: Kendalville, Jefferson, Alabama  Gender: Male   Post Office: Elyton  Value of real estate: View image  Household Members: Name Age  Ambrose Doss 36   Sarah Doss 36   
