2 CONC oth sides Pedlar.  LInes: N side Pedlar, crossing it. Wit: Wm. Matthews, Benj. Powell, Jno. Wright, Jno. Alford, Jas. Hollingsworth, Randolph Bibb.) October 19, 1794 in Amherst Co., VA (Source: Amherst Co., VA Marriage Record, McC
2 CONC abe, James, bachelor and Frances Johns, spinster, October 14, 1794.  James Calloway surety. Consent of Frances.  Ambrose Rucker testifies that Frances Johns, daughter of Robert and Mary Johns was over 21 years of age.). \par  \par
2 CONC  Aft. 1795, Moved to Jessamine Co., KY}
