1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/112239680/joseph-greer
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Greer, Sr BIRTH	6 Jan 1727 Gunpowder, Baltimore County, Maryland, USA DEATH	28 May 1781 (aged 54) Bedford County, Virginia, USA BURIAL	Unknown  MEMORIAL ID	112239680 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John G. Greer, Sr and Sarah Day.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Ann Lowe on 18 Aug 1750 in Baltimore County, MD
2 CONT
2 CONT To this union 11 children were born: Greenberry (1764-1842) John (1769-) Thomas (1758-) Priscilla Joseph, Jr Jemina Temperance Dicey Nathaniel Sarah Liz
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members Parents Photo	 John Greer 1685–1752
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 Sarah Day Greer 1686–1746
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Ann Lowe Greer 1735–1791
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings James Greer 1709–1742
2 CONT
2 CONT William Greer 1710–1785
2 CONT
2 CONT Moses Greer 1712–1777
2 CONT
2 CONT John G Greer 1714–1782
2 CONT
2 CONT Aquilla Greer 1719–1790
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Greer Starkey 1721–1762
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Greer 1721–1721
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Greer Davice 1723–1781
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Greer 1727–1787
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Photo	 Greenberry Greer 1764–1842
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT marriage is documented: "St. John's Parish Baltimore MD.18 Aug. 1750 to Ann Lowe", (1/2 sister to Rachel Lowe, & father was William Lowe JR). 
2 CONT Joseph  was "Christened  on 6 Jan 1727", "some researches think he was born 2 years prior to this date and that his "twin Benjamin" is not a twin but they were just Christened on the same date". 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Will of Joseph GREER dated 12 Oct 1766. In the will he  names his son Thomas and "other children" and names his wife Anna as Executrix. 
2 CONT He also owned land, he paid poll taxes in Lunenberg, he had a land grant in Halifax 1757
2 CONT
2 CONT HOWEVER,  thanks to Joshua DeMoss, here is a COURT Document that "Summons the Greers of Joseph and his widow"
2 CONT Library of Virginia  --Bedford County Chancery Court
2 CONT Transcribed by Nel Hatcher
2 CONT
2 CONT "The Common Wealth of Virginia To the Sheriff of Bedford County, 
2 CONT Greeting We Command you that you summon 
2 CONT Thomas Demoss & Anne his Wife who was Widow & Ex of Joseph Greer,
2 CONT George Haynes & Lucy his wife 
2 CONT Farley Hatcher & Anne his wife 
2 CONT Nathan Greer 
2 CONT Greenberry Greer & 
2 CONT Joseph, 
2 CONT Jamima,
2 CONT Priscilla,
2 CONT Temperance, 
2 CONT Tegury[?] &  (Lize “Tege”)
2 CONT Anne Greers
2 CONT to appear Before the Justices of ?ursai- County Court at the Courthouse on the fourth Monday in this month to answer a Bill in Chancery Exhibited against them by 
2 CONT Dicey Greer & Sarah Greer  
2 CONT Infant Daughters of Thomas Greer who was Eldest son of Joseph Greer deceased by John Forguson their next friend and this they shall in No wise Omit under the Penalty of one Hundred Pounds and have then there this Writ
2 CONT
2 CONT Witness James Steptoe Clerk of a?said County Court at the Court House aforesaid the Third day of October 1783 in the Eighth Year of the Common Wealth ?
2 CONT
2 CONT James Steptoe
2 CONT NOTES ON ABOVE LIST:::
2 CONT #1-LUCY  Greer?-Haynes, Geo. (not listed anywhere else)
2 CONT #2-ANNE Greer?-Hatcher, Farley (not found anywhere else)
2 CONT #3-Nathanial  mar.:Lucy  Arthur
2 CONT #4-Greenberry  mar.: Charlotte  DEMOSS
2 CONT #5-Joseph   mar.: Fanny Lyon
2 CONT #6-Jemima   mar.: Philemon SAUNDERS
2 CONT #7-Priscilla mar.: Wm.L.  DEMOSS
2 CONT #8-Temperance  mar.:#1 Ward Hatcher/#2-Wm. Burnett
2 CONT #9-Tegury  ("Tege"  aka:Lize) mar.: Caleb Heptinstall
2 CONT #10-  ANNE GREER  MAR:   THOMAS  DEMOSS  JR.......
2 CONT #10- PROVES THERE WAS a daughter Ann GREER and that Thomas DeMoss Jr. DID NOT marry his Aunt that was 35 years his senior...
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Ralph Terry rootsweb TREE This site lists all the genealogical-land books-tax records-etc.
2 CONT ALL children listed on Mr. Terry's site are linked below except for, 1 not  LINKED
2 CONT Greenberry B:  1764  #67237127
2 CONT
2 CONT His SIBLINGS: 
2 CONT #1)  WILLIAM    B: 1705--- marr: Sarah Freeland
2 CONT James      B:  1709
2 CONT Moses      B:  1712
2 CONT John       B:  1714
2 CONT Aquilla    B:  1716 
2 CONT Ann        B:  1720 
2 CONT Sarah      B:  1720
2 CONT #2) BENJAMIN   B:  1727 ---  marr. Rachel Lowe 
2 CONT #3) JOSEPH     B:  1727 ---  marr. Ann Lowe
2 CONT
2 CONT These 3 sons #1/#2/#3 are all my g-g-g grandfathers.
2 CONT They each married a cousin 1st or 2nd.  
2 CONT '**********************************************************
2 CONT Jemima, daughter-
2 CONT THIS IS THE BIO for Jemima Greer Saunders who married ...
2 CONT Pvt.  PHILEMON SAUNDERS.. 
2 CONT joined at Albermerle, County,  VA
2 CONT Rev. War Archives #S31347, this is also on file with the DAR. "served with Capt. Joseph Headen, Thomas Leftwich, Anthony Headen, and Col. Greene.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Virginia,  Marriages, 1785-1940
2 CONT NAME:  Philemon SAUNDERS
2 CONT SPOUSE:  Jemima  GREER
2 CONT DATE:  23  Nov. 1786
2 CONT PLACE:  Franklin County,  Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN  are LINKED on the Jemima #112225691
2 CONT also LINKED are her SIBLINGS 
2 CONT
2 CONT and they had  Jemima Saunders B:1795 
2 CONT who married Ezekiel GREER SR. who died 1825  just after they had their last child  Ezekiel GREER  JR.
2 CONT Jemima remarried Benjamin Harris, then moved the family to Pettis Co. Missouri
2 CONT
2 CONT The memorial "children" for JEMIMA B: 1767 is the memorial to trace our GREER family.
2 CONT THIS takes us to: Jemima GREER Saunders. which will take us down the TREE to the most current "TWIG" families. 
2 CONT AND THEN  if you want to search OUR  SAUNDERS, Philemon the REV WAR VET you can trace it from this site, 5 generations.
2 CONT
2 CONT sources: Christening Registry at St.John's Parish for Benjamin/Joseph- marriage records at St. John's Parish for Benjamin/Joseph- Will of Joseph dated 1766- land grants-poll taxes- rootsweb.com GREER Family Trees
2 CONT Nt'l Archives-Rev. War-DAR files.
