2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT As per "Winfield's Marriage Records of Virginia", pg 113  "Caleb Heptinstall married Lize Greer, on 7 Nov. 1796,  signed, by "sur. Thomas DeMoss, g.  (Guardian) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lize's husband Caleb memorial #61269653
2 CONT Caleb is a Rev. War Vet  (there is a NOTE there that says he is probably not buried there and his dod  id not right)
2 CONT
2 CONT a child is linked to Caleb's memorial 
2 CONT  Sophia Ann Heptinstall-Ferguson  #22296394
2 CONT and her headstone says  "ca. 1808"  which means I believe that they did not know her exact dob...
2 CONT
2 CONT Also the children were received by Ralph Terry from Wanda Cook.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Her husband Caleb is probably  buried here also, since his memorial is just a monument to his military record.  OR, like I saw on the CIVIL WAR on history channel last week, there are 140,000 yes 140,000 Soldiers, in UNKNOWN grave
2 CONC s as MIA, these would be our, my g-g grandfather...* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/127268519/lize-heptinstall Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 18 2022, 0:1
