2 CONT Col Samuel Judy was a prominent man in his day, and was elected as Territorial Representative of Kaskaski District, which included the county of Madison.  Upon the organization of Madison county he was elected one of the Commissio
2 CONC ners, and served the people many years in this capacity.  He was during the Indian wars, one of the Indian fighters that graced the annals of pioneer life in Illinois.  
