2 CONT Maybe the cows know where to look http://www.kxii.com/content/news/Several-headstones-damaged-in-a-Paris-cemetery--435903223.html  Several headstones damaged by cows in a Paris cemetery  Posted: Fri 6:06 PM, Jul 21, 2017  PARIS, T
2 CONC exas — Police say several headstones were damaged by cows in a Paris cemetery.  Police say they were notified Monday of the vandalism in the Lamar County Cemetery located off of FM 1 95, just  north of the Loop.  They were later n
2 CONC otified that cows had been seen in the area and saw the damage was consistent with that of large, hooved animals.  They say the damage was done sometime over the past six weeks.  According to online records there are 43 recorded b
2 CONC urials in the cemetery which was opened in 1889 as the Silver  Cross Cemetery.  Anyone with information is asked to call Detective David Whitaker at 903-737-4135. 
2 CONT
