1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of William Henry Jennings and Mary Jane Pulliam. She married Joseph A. Fowlkes of Nottoway County, son of Gabriel and Elizabeth Fowlkes. This grave was relocated to Butterwood ME from the family cemetery. 
