1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/G4T5-9RJ/thomas-arnold-jr.-1759-1820
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Thomas
2 CONT
2 CONT When Thomas Arnold Jr. was born in 1759, in Prince Edward, Virginia, United States, his father, Thomas William Arnold, was 32 and his mother, Marry Fowlkes Jennings, was 24. He married Frances Franky Jennings in 1780, in Virginia,
2 CONC  United States. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 8 daughters. He died on 8 October 1820, in Maury, Tennessee, United States, at the age of 61.
1 FAMC @F6000000014477142472@
