1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LDML-L63/william-henry-nix-1818-1875
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of William Henry
2 CONT
2 CONT When William Henry Nix was born on 16 November 1818, in Maury, Tennessee, United States, his father, Robert N. Nix, was 37 and his mother, Frances M Arnold, was 27. He married Martha Ann Hannah LEE on 2 June 1840, in Giles Town, S
2 CONC helby, Tennessee, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. He lived in Bexar, Texas, United States in 1860 and Obion, Tennessee, United States in 1870. He died in 1875, in Greenville, Hunt, Texas, U
2 CONC nited States, at the age of 57, and was buried in Wieland, Hunt, Texas, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT William Nix was a Sgt in the mexican war. He served under cpt Timothy P Jones.
