2 CONC  ff. 183-4; Hunter, ii. 212; C142/223/80. 15. Wentworth Pprs. ed. J.P. Cooper (Cam. Soc. ser. 4. xii), 32-3; Hunter, ii. 212-13. 16. C78/200/8; 78/222/1; DL1/171/6; Hunter, ii. 212; C2/Jas.I/G1/24; C2/Chas.I/H37/28; HMC 7th Rep. 5
