2 CONT '''Elizabeth Gargrave''' was christened on 19 February 1578 at Wragby, Yorkshire, England. 
2 CONT *She married '''William Fenwick, Esq., son of Richard Fenwick, Esq. and Margaret Mills, on 27 July 1605;''' 
2 CONT *They had 2 sons '''(Edward, Esq; & John, Esq.)''' and 3 daughters ('''Margaret; Cecily; & Priscilla''', wife of Roland Nevet).
