2 CONT *Venables died on 19 duly 1580. His eldest son Thomas, who was 38 when he succeeded to the estates, married as his first wife a daughter of Sir William Brereton I, and '''his second son, Anthony, also married into the family'''. A
2 CONC  daughter married another Cheshire gentleman, Peter, son and heir of Sir Piers Legh of Lyme.3
