2 CONT *'''     Elizabeth Manwaring was born circa 1535 at Over Peover, Cheshire, England. She married Peter Shakerley, Esq., son of Geoffrey Shakerley, Esq. and (Miss) Holland, circa 1551.2 Elizabeth Manwaring married Christopher Holfor
2 CONC d, Esq., son of Thomas Holford, Esq. and Margaret Boteler, on 13 July 1561 at of Over Peover, Cheshire, England.2 Elizabeth Manwaring died after 1601.
