2 CONT * Lady Frances Hastings b. 8 Jan 1693, d. 13 Oct 1750
2 CONT * Theophilus Hastings, 9th Earl of Huntingdon b. 12 Nov 1696, d. 13 Oct 1747
2 CONT * Lady Margaret Hastings b. 15 Feb 1699
2 CONT * Ferdinando Richard Hastings b. 22 Oct 1699, d. 9 Aug 1726
