2 CONT **d. Bef. 07 March 1807, Jefferson Co., KY ?.
2 CONT *6. 18.	vi.	 	JEMIMA FLOYD, 
2 CONT **b. 1753, Amherst Co., VA.
2 CONT *7. 19.	vii.	 	NANCY FLOYD, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1755; 
2 CONT **d. Bef. August 1791.
2 CONT *8. 20.	viii.	 	CHARLES FLOYD, 
2 CONT **b. 06 July 1760, Hanover Co., VA; 
