2 CONT ***Notes for JAMES FLOYD: Anna Cartlidge and others do not show James, but there appears to be one, and I will add him here pending more detail.... The child Nicati is a similar add-- makes sense that this generation have a Nicket
2 CONC ti as others do, and we know there is one aged 71 in the 1850 census living with Professor Holmes and his wife Lavalette! 
2 CONT *10. 21.	x.	 	NATHANIEL FLOYD, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1767; 
2 CONT **d. 1842, Louisville, KY.
2 CONT *11. 22.	xi.	 	ABIGAIL DAVIS FLOYD, 
