2 CONT **b. Abt. 1778.
2 CONT ***Notes for NICATI FLOYD: Anna Cartlidge and others do not show Nicati, but there appears to be one, and I will add her here pending more detail.... It makes sense that this generation have a Nicketti as others do, and we know th
2 CONC ere is one aged 71 in the 1850 census living with Professor Holmes and his wife Lavalette! We do not know where she arose from, however.... 
