2 CONT "You know how I have been working on Lillian Parker/Hampton, wife of Robert Clark Floyd. Well, I have my first link in Amherst County! of sorts. Theodosia Davis, daughter of Nathaniel Davis and Elizabeth Atkins, married Jarratt Gi
2 CONC lliam. Theodosia would be the first cousin of Robert Clark Floyd. 
