2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/5993405/william-robert-burks
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ca 1743 VA
2 CONT Death: ca 1845 GA
2 CONT
2 CONT William married Lurena "Lenora" Harris (b. ca 1745 VA d. ca 1800 GA) around ca 1765 in Virginia.  She was the daughter of Ellender "Eleanor" Sullivan and Nathaniel Harris, whose father was Edward E. Harris.  William's parents were
2 CONC  Richard Burks and Francis (Horsley) Burks.  Richard's parents were Samuel and Mary (Davis) Burks.  Mary's brother was said to be the ancestor of Jefferson Davis.  William and Lenora were the parents of David Burks, John Burks, *W
2 CONC illiam Burks Jr.* (line of Shirley Burks Wells), Robert Burks and Elisha Burks.  David married Lucy Dunston, William Burks Jr. married Mary Dunston, Robert Burks married Susannah Dunston and Elisha Burks married Patience Dunston, 
2 CONC daughters of Charles Dunston and Elizabeth (Middleton) Dunston.  John, David and possibly Robert went to TN.
