2 CONT Alexander CUNNINGHAM died in 1779 in Prince Edward County, Virginia. (274) 
2 CONT Parents: Alexander CUNNINGHAM and (unknown) BELL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: 
2 CONT # Judith, 
2 CONT # William, 
2 CONT # Josiah, 
2 CONT # Elizabeth, 
2 CONT # Susannah, 
2 CONT # Jacob, 
2 CONT # Nathanial, 
2 CONT # John M., 
2 CONT # Paul Michaux Cunningham.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Alexander CUNNINGHAM was born about 1650 in Virginia.(2) He was born in York County, Virginia.(387) Some information taken from "The Mecklenberg Signers and their Neighbors" by Worth, where he notes that: "Alexander Cunningham mov
2 CONC ed to Goochland County with the DANIEL family and where his children intermarried with a French Huguenot family named Michaux. . . "
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT See the Michaux Bible and Prayer Book at Episcopal Seminary, Alexandria, VA
2 CONT ----
