1 NAME Olive Judi /Michaux/
2 GIVN Olive Judi
2 SURN Michaux
2 _MARNM Morgan
2 NICK Judi
2 NICK Judy
2 NICK Judith
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1706
2 PLAC Manakin Town 
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Virginia
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 JUL 1762
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Did NOT marry John Dorian Morgan
2 CONT Married Anthony Morgan. TWO known children.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT OLIVE JUDI MICHAUX-MORGAN was born circa 1706 in Manakin Town, Virgina, and was the daughter of the well known Dr. Abraham Michaux & wife Suzanne Rochet-Michaux who escaped persecution in France for their "Huguenot" Christian Fait
2 CONC h. Manakin Town was originally in Henrico County, VA then in 1728 Goochland County was carved out of Henrico County, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Olive married Anthony Morgan circa 1724 in Cumberland County, Virginia, and they had TWO daughters of record:
2 CONT # Elizabeth Michaux Morgan-Minter (1725-1797) & 
2 CONT # Agnes Morgan-Clopton (?-1809).
2 CONT
2 CONT Olive passed away on 27 October 1760 in Cumberland County, Virginia, and was buried there.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ==links==
2 CONT * http://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Michaux-21
2 CONT
2 CONT REFERENCES:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Named in Father's Will.
2 CONT "Item, I give to my Daughter Olive Judi the remaining part of the aforesaid land be the same more or less to be left on one side or other the aforesaid plantation to have and to hold to her and her heirs forever."
2 CONT
2 CONT Colonial Wills of Henrico County, Virginia, Part One, 1654-1737, Wills and Deeds 1714-1718, Dated 13 May 1717, Abraham Michaux, Recorded 5 Aug. 1717, Wit: John Atkinson, Bartholomew Cox, Stephen Hughes.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Named in Family Lineage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Drews, Toby, 1981, "Genealogies of Virginia Families: from The Virginia Magazine of History and Biography," Vol. IV, Genealogical Publishing Co, Inc.: Baltimore, p. 328, 331, 363, & 364.
2 CONT
2 CONT HUGUENOT:
2 CONT 1. Registered Lineages with the Huguenot Society of the Founders of Manakin in the Colony of Virginia: Generation II, Olive Michaux,
2 CONT http://manakin.addr.com/manakin/lineages.php
2 CONT
2 CONT MARRIAGE:
