2 CONT 2.  Ann7 Anderson (Thomas6, Robert5, Robert4, Richard3, "York Watershed"2, "Colonial Virginia"1) was born December 1706 in New Kent County, Virginia, and died Bef. 1776 in Hanover County, Virginia.  She married '''James Allen''' D
2 CONC ecember 07, 1721 in Hanover County, Virginia.  He was born 1699, and died 1771.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ann Anderson and James Allen are:
2 CONT # Dorcas8 Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), "Electronic."), born 1722; died 1753.  She married Matthew Sims.
2 CONT # James Anderson Allen, born July 07, 1724; died 1793.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), born 1726.
2 CONT # Daniel Anderson Allen, born September 12, 1728 in Hanover County, Virginia; died 1807 in Cumberland County, Virginia.
