1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Children of Thomas Anderson and Agnes Gannaway are:
2 CONT
2 CONT +      2                 i.    Ann7 Anderson, born December 1706 in New Kent County, Virginia; died Bef. 1776 in Hanover County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Will of Thomas Anderson Probated in Albemarle County March 9, 1758 Albemarle County Will Book 2, p. 38
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT > Item:  I Give and bequeath to my Daughter Ann Allen the Increase of her Negro wench Hannah to her & her Heirs forever.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://homepages.rootsweb.com/~anderson/va/trees/thomas1.html
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Ann7 Anderson (Thomas6, Robert5, Robert4, Richard3, "York Watershed"2, "Colonial Virginia"1) was born December 1706 in New Kent County, Virginia, and died Bef. 1776 in Hanover County, Virginia.  She married James Allen Decembe
2 CONC r 07, 1721 in Hanover County, Virginia.  He was born 1699, and died 1771.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Ann Anderson:
2 CONT From Thomas Anderson's will - Item:  I Give and bequeath to my Daughter Ann Allen the Increase of her Negro wench Hannah to her & her Heirs forever.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ann Anderson and James Allen are:
2 CONT # Dorcas8 Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), "Electronic."), born 1722; died 1753.  She married Matthew Sims.
2 CONT # James Anderson Allen, born July 07, 1724; died 1793.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), "Electronic."), born 1726.
2 CONT # Daniel Anderson Allen, born September 12, 1728 in Hanover County, Virginia; died 1807 in Cumberland County, Virginia.
2 CONT # Charles Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), born 1730; died 1733.
2 CONT # Frances Anderson Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), born Bet. 1731 - 1732.
2 CONT # Anna Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), born 1734.
2 CONT # Martha Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), born Bet. 1735 - 1736.
2 CONT # Richard Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), born Bet. 1737 - 1738.
2 CONT # Anna Allen(Fredericksburg, VA.), born 1738.
2 CONT # Anne Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), born 1739.
2 CONT # Sarah Allen(Fredericksburg, VA.), born 1745.
2 CONT # Benjamin Anderson Allen (Fredericksburg, VA.), born 1748.
2 CONT # Charles Anderson Allen  (Fredericksburg, VA.), born 1748.
