1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Israel Huddleston''' was born in 1803 in Smith County, Tennessee, United States. 
2 CONT His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-9079519 Abraham H. Huddleston, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-9079486 Mary Ellen Huddleston (Allen)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Israel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34723902056 Malinda Huddleston Goodwin (Baty)] in 1826 in Wayne County, MO, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34723902057 William Sampson Huddleston]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34728967308 Sarah Talley (Huddleston)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34729129601 Martha Staton (Huddleston)];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34729131029 Nancy Smith Moore McDaniel (Huddleston)].  
2 CONT
2 CONT He made his will July 17, 1740 and Malinda Huddleston is in the 1840 census so he died after his will but before the census. She remarried in 1841.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Wife Malinda and 4 children named in his July 1840 will:
2 CONT # William S Huddleston
2 CONT # Sally Huddleston
2 CONT # Matilda Huddleston
2 CONT # Nancy Huddleston
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: There is a [https://www.geni.com/profile-34729129601 Matthew or Martha Huddleston] in the 1850 census with mother Malinda. It is unimaginable that Israel would leave out a child when writing his will. Since Israel signed the
2 CONC  will with his mark (an X), he likely said Martha or Mattie and the person writing his will wrote it as Matilda.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.genealogy.com/ftm/d/a/v/Kathy-S-Davis/GENE2-0004.html; https://www.genealogy.com/ftm/d/a/v/Kathy-S-Davis/GENE2-0007.html#CHILD25
2 CONT The Wayne Co., MO census shows Abraham aged between 50 and 60. Joseph between 30 and 40, Nathan, Charles, Israel, and John all between 20 and 30, as heads of families.
2 CONT 25.ISRAEL10 HUDDLESTON (ABRAHAM H.9, WILLIAM8, HENRY II7, HENRY I6, RICHARD5, HENRY4, HENRY3, EDMUND2, JOHN1) was born 1803, and died Abt. 1839.He married MALINDA BATY 1826.She was born 1803.
2 CONT Notes for ISRAEL HUDDLESTON:
2 CONT 1850 HUDDLESTON ISRAEL Knox County TN 157 15th Sub Division Federal Population Schedule TN 1850 Federal Census Index TNS5a859676
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of ISRAEL HUDDLESTON and MALINDA BATY is:
2 CONT 37.	i.	 	WILLIAM SAMPSON11 HUDDLESTON, b. May 8, 1828, Missouri; d. February 9, 1890.
2 CONT
