2 CONT Information about Nathan
2 CONT
2 CONT Posted 02 May 2010 by vernabb
2 CONT
2 CONT From the website: http://mjgen.com/huddleston/4abraham.html
2 CONT
2 CONT * 3c6f) NATHAN was born in 1805 in Smith County, Tennessee. 
2 CONT * He married Margaret Perkins. (He and his brother, Joseph, married sisters).  
2 CONT * In 1830 they were in Wayne Co, Mo; in 1840 in Ripley Co, MO; in 1850 in Oregon Co, MO (same location).  
2 CONT * He was appointed administrator of his brother, Joseph’s estate, Jan. 4, 1858, but he died early in 1860 and a new administrator was appointed for Joseph’s estate in Aug. 1860.   
2 CONT * In 1860 Margaret was in Oregon Co. with their younger children and she also had George Marion Huddleston (son of Joseph & her sister, Elizabeth).  She died before 1870.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT #  3c6f1)     WILLIAM HUDDLESTON, b 1827, AR; m Aug 6, 1846, Oregon Co, MO to Martha Ann (Old) Howell; d before 1860; Ch: Martha (m R.W. Wagoner & Wm. Dial), Pernicia (or Persina, b June 1850, MO), Allis (Alice?)
2 CONT #  3c6f2)      JAMES HUDDLESTON, b 1829, MO; m Feb 29, 1852 to Sarah Brown; he d before 1854 & Sarah m 2nd Samuel Hurst; she m 3rd James Allman
2 CONT #  3c6f3)      MARY HUDDLESTON, b 1831, MO; m Apr 6, 1851 to Abraham DePriest; divorced and m 2nd Samuel Hurst. She died about 1854 and Sam married the widow of her brother, Sally Brown Huddleston, and then they also divorced.
2 CONT #  3c6f4)      JOHN HUDDLESTON, b Dec 11, 1832, MO; m Nov 23, 1854, Nancy Gum; d Jan 9, 1904, Oregon Co, MO.  Ch: Mary E, Artimissa M., Eliza M., Susan Margaret, William N., Marion (or Manerva, girl)
2 CONT #  3c6f5)      JESSE HUDDLESTON, b abt 1834, MO; m Nov 24, 1854, Margaret Boze; moved to Fannin Co, TX; d after 1880, TX; Ch: J.H., Pernettie
2 CONT #  3c6f6)      ELIZABETH HUDDLESTON, b 1836, MO; may have m Richard Boze, Mar 31, 1856
2 CONT #  3c6f7)      CHARLES HUDDLESTON, b abt 1838, MO; unmarried
2 CONT #  3c6f8)      SARAH HUDDLESTON, b abt 1842, MO; unmarried
2 CONT #  3c6f9)      MARGARET HUDDLESTON, b abt 1844; m Benjamin O. Bates, 1860
2 CONT #  3c6f10)    GEORGE RILEY HUDDLESTON, b abt 1846, MO
2 CONT #  3c6f11)    NATHAN BOWLIN (Boulin) HUDDLESTON, b abt 1849, MO
2 CONT
