2 CONT A Real Daughter of the American Revolution.
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried in the cemetery is Nancy Jameson Holcome who was a Real Daughter of the American Revolution. Her father was Thomas Jameson, an American Revolutiony War veteran, who married Hannah Taggart in 1764 and had nine children.
