1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A129206 DAR Ancestor #: A129206]
2 CONT Son of Patriot [https://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A129205 DAR Ancestor #: A129205]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''John &quot;Poplar Foot&quot; Woodson, Jr.''' was born circa 1744 in Goochland County, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883661 John Woodson] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-83384561 Mar
2 CONC y Woodson (Miller)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883735 Joanna Susanna Woodson (Booker)] circa 1765 in Of, Cumberland, Virginia, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883736 Booker Woodson]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883738 Benjamin Woodson]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34644389567 Peter Henry Woodson]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883740 James Woodson]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883739 Joseph Nathaniel Woodson]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-65167657 Elizabeth Wright (Woodson)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-59576372 Woodson].  
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34680475239 Elizabeth Venable Woodson (Raine)] circa 1785. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34687148509 Nancy C. Ligon (Woodson)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34630518326 Sarah Hatcher Smith (Woodson)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883742 Betsy Woodson]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34825692687 John Miller Woodson]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34825691603 Susannah Williams (Woodson)].  
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on September 24, 1821 in Cumberland County, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT John Woodson was called "Poplar Foot" because of his unusually large feet. He was considered "a very eloquent speaker, and a man of splendid physique." 
2 CONT Married twice-- first to Joanna Booker and they had 5 sons and 1 daughter. He secondly married Elizabeth Raine, widow of John Venable and together they had 1 son and 5 daughters.
2 CONT John served in the Revolutionary War.
2 CONT ----
