1 NOTE {geni:about_me} in 1673 Richard Buckner established a tobacco warehouse which was later acquired by John Roy. Later his widow, Dorothy Roy, became the first female in colonial Virginia to have a chartered warehouse.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorothy Buckner, sister of Richard Buckner, was born in 1673 in Rappahannock County, married Charles Smith in 1700, then, after he died in 1710, married John Roy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was NOT the mother of Hannah Roy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her children were Robert Smith (from the first marriage), Thomas Roy, John Roy, Jr., Reuben Roy, Mungo Roy, Richard M Roy, Mary Roy, and Elizabeth Roy.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Disputed Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Buckner-320
2 CONT
2 CONT >Ralph Emmett Fall argued that Dorothy was a daughter of Richard Buckner.[6] Her birthdate is unclear, though it could not have been much later than 1685 if she was married by 1701. The current estimate in this profile is 1680, bu
2 CONC t in any event, her likely birthdate is much earlier than the earliest reasonable dates for any of Richard Buckner's known children, so if she was Richard's, she must have been by an earlier unknown marriage. On the other hand, it
2 CONC 's also a fairly late date for any of John Buckner's (Richard's father) children, so she is not an easy fit into any of the known Buckner families of the period. The most popular alternate theory is that she was a Peyton, based la
2 CONC rgely on circumstantial evidence.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT * [https://books.google.com/books?id=vXtNCAAAQBAJ&lpg=PT433&ots=FK-Qqz383e&dq=dorothy%20peyton%20charles%20smith&pg=PT431#v=onepage&q&f=false link] to Buckner:, Volume 1 By Jimmy White Dorothy Buckner (1673 to 1745), daughter of R
2 CONC ichard Buckner, married Charles Smith on 6 June 1700 in Essex County He was born 1655 in York County to Major Lawrence Smith and Mary Debnam.  Child of this marriage was Robert Smith (1701 to 1744) married Elizabeth Hunt.  She nex
2 CONC t married John Roy in 1708 [SIC: after 1710] in Essex County Virginia ...
2 CONT *T.E. Campbell, Colonial Caroline, Richmond: Dietz Press, 1954, p. 411
2 CONT *T.E. Campbell, Colonial Caroline, Richmond: Dietz Press, 1954, p. 472
2 CONT *http://www.historicportroyal.net/project/the-dorothy-roy-chimneys/
2 CONT *1704-1707 Essex Co VA Deed & Will Book 12; Antient Press, p. 323
2 CONT *See http://colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I024242&tree=Tree1
2 CONT *Ralph Emmett Fall, Hidden Village, Port Royal Virginia, 1744-1981 Port Royal (Va.): R.E. Fall, 1982, p. 24
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Not a known child of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Buckner-of-Petsworth-Parish/6000000002806027261?through=6000000003703039458
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth date also reported as 1657,
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorothy Buckner's husband John Roy was the son of Richard Roy
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Family 2	Charles Smith,   b. 1670, Abbington Parish, Gloucester County, Virginia    d. 10 Aug 1710, St. Mary's Parish, Essex County, Virginia - bond 
2 CONT Married	6 Jun 1700 	St. Mary's Parish, Essex County, Virginia 
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT 1. Robert Smith,   b. 1700, St. Mary's Parish, Essex County, Virginia    d. Aft 1771, St. George's Parish, Spotsylvania County, Virginia 
2 CONT 2. Peyton Smith,   b. 1709, St. Mary's Parish, Essex County, Virginia   d. 15 Aug 1782, Spotsylvania County, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She married (1) CHARLES SMITH, CAPT. 06 Jan 1699/00 in Essex Co., VA.He was born 1655 in York Co., VA, and died Bef. 10 Aug 1710 in Bef 10 Aug 1710.She married (2) JOHN ROY, SR. 1708 in Essex Co., VA, son of RICHARD ROY and DOROTH
2 CONC Y PEYTON.He was born 1681, and died 10 Oct 1734.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of DOROTHY BUCKNER and CHARLES SMITH is:
2 CONT i.	 	ROBERT9 SMITH, b. 1701, Essex Co., VA; d. 1744, Caroline Cty., VA; m. ELIZABETH HUNT; b. 1705; d. 1766.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of DOROTHY BUCKNER and JOHN ROY are:
2 CONT 135.	ii.	 	THOMAS9 ROY, b. 1709, New Kent Cty.,Virginia; d. 1772, Port Royal Cty., VA.
2 CONT iii.	 	JOHN ROY JR., b. 1711, New Kent Cty.,Virginia.
2 CONT iv.	 	REUBEN ROY, b. 1713, New Kent Cty.,Virginia; d. 1767, Caroline Cty., VA.
2 CONT v.	 	MUNGO ROY, b. 1715, New Kent Cty.,Virginia; d. Bef. 19 Nov 1758, Essex Co., VA.
2 CONT vi.	 	RICHARD M. ROY, b. 1719, New Kent Cty.,Virginia; d. 1795, Caroline Cty., VA.
2 CONT vii.	 	MARY ROY, b. 1719, New Kent Cty.,Virginia; d. Bef. 1775, Fredericksburg, VA.
2 CONT viii.	 	ELIZABETH (BETTY) ROY, b. 1721, New Kent Cty.,Virginia; d. 17 Nov 1742, Williamsburg, VA.
