1 NOTE {geni:about_me} My fourth Great Grandfather, William B. Graves (Genealogy #138) was born about 1761, and died by 2 May 1825 in Nicholas Co., KY.  He was recorded as “William B. Graves Decd” on a deed dated 2 May 1825 in Nicholas C
2 CONC o. KY.  One researcher indicated he was William Barton Graves, but no source has been found for this information.  In another account, his sun, William B. Graves was said to be William Bartlett Graves, Jr., indicating that his fat
2 CONC her would be William Bartlett Graves, Sr.  He married Judith (or Judah) Harrison , daughter of Joseph Lovell Harrison and Margaret (“Peggy”) Richardson, on 29 Dec. 1779 in Louisa Co., VA.  She was born about 1761, and died about 1
2 CONC 836 in Nicholas Co., KY.
2 CONT
2 CONT By Harry Dotson (partially from Graves Family Ancestry Website). 5/10/2013
