2 CONT
2 CONT Married Joseph Coleman of Cumberland county, VA on 24 January 1782. Moved to Union district SC from VA in December 1786 with a growing family, eventually having 12 children. Joseph Coleman died in 1806 in Union county, SC and Sith
2 CONC ey Coleman remarried about 1820 to (2) John Bowles of Union county, SC who, like her first husband, also had Rev War service in the VA Continental line. John Bowles died in February 1836, and Sithey Bowles died on 16 July 1844.* R
2 CONC eference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/206449918/scytha-bowles Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 16 2021, 4:10:12 UTC''
