1 NAME Elizabeth Goodridge /Venable/
2 GIVN Elizabeth Goodridge
2 SURN Venable
2 _MARNM Carrington
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
