1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Frances Venable Leach''' was born on December 19, 1826, in Cumberland, Virginia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-8100811 Rev. James Henry Cosden Leitch, (Pantops)] and [https://www.geni.com/profile
2 CONC -34651325190 Frances Anderson Venable]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances married [https://www.geni.com/profile-8101482 John Alexander Lancaster] circa 1849. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-8101522 Nathaniel Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648540672 Sallie Elizabeth Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710786742 Richard Venable Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710786752 William Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710786754 James Leitch Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710786759 John A. Lancaster]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 8, 1903, in Cumberland, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
