1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for VIRGINIA.  [http://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A127302  DAR Ancestor # A127302]
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin, the first child of Willis and Elizabeth Goodrich Wilson, was born December 26, 1733, at the home of his grand¬ father, Benjamin Goodrich, at or near the junction of the Chica¬ hominy and James Rivers. He married Miss Ann
2 CONC  Seay and settled on the Willis River in Cumberland County, Virginia.
2 CONT
