1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joseph was the son of Dr. Joseph Morton & Mary F. Cowan Venable. By trade he became a merchant and started a brick and lumber yard. His life was taken tragically during a Yellow Fever Epidemic. (bio information pro
2 CONC vided by descendant, Jean R. Meaney Wheatly)
