1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "John Edwards was a captain in the colonial militia and was with the First Virginia Regiment in the French and Indian War. His wife, Jane Arrington was a daughter of Thomas Arrington of Westmoreland county."
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * GENERAL JOHN EDWARDS KING, OF KENTUCKY
2 CONT * Goode King Feldhauser
2 CONT * Register of Kentucky State Historical Society
2 CONT * Vol. 27, No. 80 (May, 1929), pp. 548-551
2 CONT * Published by: Kentucky Historical Society
2 CONT * Stable URL: http://www.jstor.org/stable/23370031
2 CONT
