1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wife: Sophia Elizabeth Burgess
2 CONT
2 CONT Also seen as child of https://www.geni.com/people/Judith-King/6000000009958863024?through=4054815845480121346 & https://www.geni.com/people/William-King/6000000099032368853?through=6000000009958863024
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://king.genealogy.googlepages.com/%22thekingfamily%22bygoodekingfeldhausergeorgem.g.stafford
2 CONT
2 CONT WILLIAM ALFRED KING, eldest son of Captain William King and his 2nd wife, Judith Peyton, was born in Stafford County, Va., about 1685. He married Sophia Burgess, daughter of John and Elizabeth Burgess, and grand-daughter of Col. W
2 CONC illiam Burgess and Sophia Ewell (or Ewen). They lived on a part of the Ewell estate near the site of the present town of Dumfries, in Prince William County, Va. (It was then Stafford County). There were many children born of this 
2 CONC marriage, ten of whom were sons. There were probably daughters, but we have no record of them. The sons were: 1. - William, 2. - Alfred, 3 - Thomas, 4. - Benjamin, 5. - John, 6. - Robert, 7. - Richard, 8. - Walter, 9. - Francis, 1
2 CONC 0. - Edward. We regret our inability to report definitely on any of these except William and Thomas. As William the eldest of the ten, is the progenitor of the branch in which we are particularly interested and will take up most o
2 CONC f the space in this manuscript, we will first dispose of his brother Thomas.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Martha RICHARDSON and William KING are:
2 CONT
2 CONT v. William Alfred KING was born 10 Mar 1683/84 in Stafford County, Brooke Virginia, and died 21 Dec 1727 in Stafford County, Brooke Virginia. He married Sophia Elizabeth BURGESS 1710 in Strafford, Virginia. She was born Abt 1690 i
2 CONC n Prince William, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT William Alfred KING was born 10 MAR 1684 in Brooke, Stafford, Virginia, was christened 15 MAR 1684 in Christchurch, Middlesex, Virginia, and died 21 DEC 1727 in , Stafford, Virginia. He was the son of . William KING and  Judith PE
2 CONC YTON. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sites.google.com/site/kinggenealogy/williamking%281711-1778%29
2 CONT
2 CONT William1 King (199) was born in 1711 at Stafford Co., Va.  As of 1711, he was also known as (199) This William King (199), eldest son of William Alfred King and Sophia Burgess, is sometimes incorrectly referred to as William Valen
2 CONC tine King or Valentine King.  He married Elizabeth Edwards (271), daughter of John Edwards (272) and Jane Arrington (273), on 21 May 1738.  He was Clerk of the Court and Justice of Stafford County between 1742 and 1760.  He died i
2 CONC n 1778 at Dumfries, Prince William Co., Va.
2 CONT
