2 CONT OATES, Jesse, private, N.C. Malitia
2 CONT Soldier was born in 1756 to Jethro and Artesha (probably King)
2 CONT Oates. Married first to Laruhama Stevens who was born 1758 and
2 CONT died before 13 Apr 1797. Soldier married 2nd on 13 Apr 1798 to
2 CONT Zilpha Mason.
2 CONT The children from the two marriages were:
2 CONT 1- William (1782-1833) who died in Miss.
2 CONT 2- Jethro who killed David Cogdell in a duel and had to leave N.C.,
2 CONT     going to Ky.
2 CONT 3- Nancy.
2 CONT 4- David.
2 CONT 5- Bryan.
2 CONT 6- John Mason born 1800.
2 CONT 7 Elizabeth.
2 CONT 8- Jesse Jr.
2 CONT 9- Richard Mason.
2 CONT 10- Rachel.
2 CONT 11- Mariah.
2 CONT 12- Zilpha Ann.
2 CONT 13- Matthews Mason.
2 CONT 14- Harriett.
2 CONT 15- Oliver Hays.
2 CONT 16- Wyatt. And
2 CONT 17- Charles Campbell.
2 CONT They later removed to Muhlenberg county, Ky, where Jesse died
2 CONT on 10 Aug 1831.
