1 NAME Nathaniel M. /King/ Sr
2 GIVN Nathaniel M.
2 SURN King
2 NSFX Sr
2 _MARNM King
2 NICK Nathaniel
2 NICK Nathanial King
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1775
2 PLAC South Carolina, British Colonial America
