1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There are two Francis Clarks in America in this era. This Francis Clark (II) is NOT Reverend Francis Clark of Kentucky, and did not have that title. This Francis Clark was married to Christian Stone, and was mentio
2 CONC ned in the will of Francis Clark "The Elder". 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/details/LRQV-36X
2 CONT This Quaker, Francis Clark, Jr. of Virginia married Christian Stone on 14 Dec 1746 in Friends Meeting House in Caroline County, Province of Virginia and moved to British Colony of North Carolina. 
2 CONT Children of Francis Clark, Jr. and Christian Stone: 
2 CONT Molly Clark (1747-1839) married John Thomas (1743-1814); 
2 CONT Betty Clark (b 1749) married John Haley/Hailey; 
2 CONT Nicholas Clark (b 1750); 
2 CONT John "Francis" Clark (b 1753) married Margaret Johnson; 
2 CONT Cornelius Clark (1755-1797) married Sarah Richardson; 
2 CONT Milly Clark (1756-1928) married James Thomas and Thomas Willcuts.
2 CONT DO NOT combine with children of Methodist Minister in KY, Francis Clark (1730-1799)!!
2 CONT
2 CONT
