1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah was born in 1713 in Louisa, Louisa, Virginia, United States. She was the daughter of Francis Clark Sr. and Cordelia (Lankford) Clark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah died at the age of about 70 about 1783 in Elizabethtown, Bladen, North Carolina, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ 1.0 1.1 Family Tree record for Cordelia Langford: Ancestry Member Family Tree,
2 CONT Page: Database online. Data: Text: Record for Cordelia Langford.
