1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William and Rachel had the following Children. Hannah, John, Joel, James, Polly, Susanna, Jacob, Sallie, William H., Rebecca, Martha and Isom.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is a large stone in the cemetery inscribed:
2 CONT In memory of William East Born in North Carolina in 1773. Died in 1864. Rachel Tolbert East Born in Virginia and 1780, died in 1851.  Erected by their descendants, Aug. 14, 1909.
2 CONT --by Byron & Mable 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT Their 12 children are inscribed on the back of the family marker.
2 CONT Daughter Hannah has a Cenotaph here in Birch Lake Cemetery and is buried with her 2nd husband in Prairie Grove Cemetery.
2 CONT Daughter Martha has a Cenotaph here and is buried in Missouri.
2 CONT It's unknown at this time if any of the other children with no headstone photo of their own may also be buried elsewhere (namely, John, Susana, Sallie, William, Rebecca).
