1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Possibly due to failing health, Robert Addams wrote his Will in Feb 1738. His estate was left to his wife Mourning, sons James and Robert and daughters Judith Clark, Mary Moreman [Moorman], Eliza Moreman [Moorman],
2 CONC  Agnes Farguson [Ferguson], Susanna, Lucy, Anna the younger and Sally.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. JAMES3 FERGUSON, JR (JAMES2, JOHN1)1,2,3,4,5 was born Abt. 1719 in Virginia(?), and died Abt. 1788 in Chester COUNTY, S.CAROLINA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married AGNES ADAMS6,7 Bet. 1735 - 1738 in Goochland Co., Virginia, daughter of ROBERT ADAMS and MOURNING LEWIS. She was born Abt. 1718 in Virginia, and died Aft. 1788 in South Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JAMES FERGUSON and AGNES ADAMS are:
2 CONT # i. BETTY4 FERGUSON7,8, d. Unknown.
2 CONT # ii. JOSEPH FERGUSON9,10, d. Unknown.
2 CONT # iii. MOURNING FERGUSON11,12, d. August 31, 1822.
2 CONT # 2. iv. WILLIAM FERGUSON, b. Bet. 1736 - 1740; d. 1788.
2 CONT # 3. v. JAMES FERGUSON III, b. Abt. 1740, Goochland Co., Virginia; d. July 12, 1780, Williams Plantation, York Co.,SC.
2 CONT # 4. vi. ADAMS FERGUSON, SR, b. Abt. 1743, Goochland Co., Virginia; d. 1822, Chester COUNTY, S.CAROLINA.
2 CONT # 5. vii. ROBERT FERGUSON, SR, b. Abt. 1745, Goochland Co., Virginia; d. 1795, Chester COUNTY, S.CAROLINA.
2 CONT # 6. viii. ABRAHAM FERGUSON, SR, b. January 30, 1751, Goochland Co., Virginia; d. November 09, 1826,
2 CONT # Chester COUNTY, S.CAROLINA.
2 CONT # 7. ix. SAMUEL FERGUSON, SR, b. Abt. 1755, Granville, North Carolina; d. June 08, 1817, Chester COUNTY, S.CAROLINA.
2 CONT # x. AGNES FERGUSON13,14, b. Abt. 1765; d. Aft. 1846; m. EDWARD STEDMAN, January 10, 1785; d. Unknown
2 CONT ----
