1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Judith Moorman was born about 1711 in New Kent County, Virginia, the daughter of Charles Moorman and Elizabeth (Reynolds) Moorman. This date is based on the known age of her eldest child.
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith married John Douglas in 1731 in Virginia. John was born in 1711 in Scotland*. He died in Orange County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John DOUGLAS and Judith MOORMAN are: 
2 CONT * 1. Thomas DOUGLAS, b. September 02, 1740  & Margaret ?   
2 CONT * 2. Charles DOUGLAS, b. April 29, 1732    
2 CONT * 3. Elizabeth DOUGLAS, b. December 18, 1733    
2 CONT * 4. Polly DOUGLAS, b. June 12, 1744    
2 CONT * 5. Judith DOUGLAS, b. July 18, 1746    
2 CONT * 6. John DOUGLAS, b. August 08, 1748    
2 CONT * 7. Anne DOUGLAS, b. 10 FEB 1749/50    
2 CONT * 8. Achilles DOUGLAS, b. 22 FEB 1750/51. He died on 5 Nov 1810.    
2 CONT * 9. Dorcas DOUGLAS, b. January 09, 1755  
