1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Ann Moorman
2 CONT * Birth: abt 1717 
2 CONT * Death:	1766
2 CONT * Parents:	Charles M Moorman, Elizabeth Reynolds
2 CONT * Husband:	Thomas Martin
2 CONT
2 CONT Married before 14 Aug 1741 when Ann and her husband, Thomas Martin, were witnesses to Capt. Christopher Clark's will. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Martin, Captain (6 Jan 1713/14 Caroline [Albermarel] County, Virginia - Dec 1792 Elbert, Ga.....will in Albemarle County Va..Book 3 page 144
2 CONT
2 CONT children of Thomas Martin:
2 CONT
2 CONT * i Mildred 'Milly' MARTIN, b. 1742 See Micajah CLARK
2 CONT * ii Charles Martin was born in 1741. He died in 1808.Charles MARTIN, b. 1745 See Patsy MOON
2 CONT * iii Thomas Martin. b. August 18, 1755 ; Thomas Martin, (1752-1814), served as lieutenant in the Virginia Continental Line, 1777-81. He was an original member of the Cincinnati. He was born in Albemarle Co., Va. The National Soci
2 CONC ety of the Daughters of the American Revolution Volume 32 page 219
2 CONT * iv John Martin was born on 20 Mar 1748/1749. He died on 3 Dec 1837. married Elizabeth Lewis.
2 CONT * v Pleasant Martin was born on 21 Dec 1755. He died on 16 Oct 1836. married Rebecca Joplin on 2 Oct 1775 in Amherst County,Virginia.
2 CONT * vi Letitia MARTIN, b. 1743 See Richard MOORE
2 CONT * vii Ann Martin. married Unknown Blaine.
2 CONT * viii Mary Ann MARTIN, b. May 24, 1766 See Benjamin DAWSON
2 CONT * ix George Martin, b:1762. married Barbara Woods.
2 CONT * x. James MARTIN, b. August 18, 1755 in Albemarle County, Virginia.
2 CONT * xi. Elizabeth MARTIN, b. December 25, 1758 See William MOORMAN
2 CONT * xii. Judith MARTIN, b. 1765 See Richard MOORE
2 CONT * xiii. Nancy MARTIN, b. May 01, 1753 See Alexander BLAIN
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
