1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Achilles Moorman''' was born on December 2, 1744 in Cedar Creek, Hanover County, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-41235771 Thomas Moorman, Sr] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-41235772 Ra
2 CONC chel Ballard]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Achilles married [https://www.geni.com/profile-42239964 Frances Moorman] in 1778 in Bedford County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700519014 Achilles L. Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-15069648293 Charles Hancock Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700516316 Martha Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700517018 Thomas Clark Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700519503 Edmund Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700519591 Mary Wilkins Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34698879584 Pleasant Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700588845 Patsy Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700588892 David Herndon Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700616992 Frances Fanny Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700617107 Letitia Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700617404 Lafayette O. Moorman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34700617445 Elizabeth M. Moorman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on May 25, 1809 in Campbell County, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Achilles Moorman b 2 Dec 1744, d 25 May 1809, Campbell, VA; md Frances Herndon 11 Apr 1778.
2 CONT * Father-Thomas Moorman
2 CONT * Mother-Rachael (Clark) Moorman
