2 CONT
2 CONT I read that where William Henry Moon and wife Sally Richardson Moon-were buried on their property in Ga. and now the graves are underwater -as the Broad River changed courses! -I believe  that they were buried on their property! 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also, when they left Halifax, Va-to go to Ga. sold their house and 2 Moon cemetery's-small graveyards one is Moon Slave Cemetery and other one only had a couple of graves-the house was torned down and now race tract- They and half
2 CONC  the children went with them and some did stay in Va.-which was one of my line!
