2 CONT * '''DAR Records:''' Jacob Moon, Sr., Ancestor #: A079193.
2 CONT * '''Secondary Reference:''' Young, Willie Pauline. "Abstracts of Old Ninety-six and Abbeville Districts Wills and Bonds" (1950).
2 CONT * '''Marriage Records:''' Albemarle County, Virginia, Marriage Bonds (1783) for daughter Betsy Martin.
2 CONT * ABSTRACT OF CHARLES MARTIN'S WILL, ABBEVILLE COUNTY, S.C.; Box 64, Pack 1548. Found in book titled "Abstracts of Old Ninety-six and Abbeville Districts Wills and Bonds", compiled by Willie Pauline Young, published 1950.  Will da
2 CONC ted June 28, 1808 in Abbeville District. Recorded October 25, 1808. Executors: Wife, Polly Martin, Jacob, George W. Martin. Witnesses: William Drinkard, Samuel Linton, Nathaniel Bolen. Wife, Polly Martin. Children: Jacob, George W
2 CONC ashington, William Martin, Suckey Moore, Salley Nichols. Grandchildren: Jas., Thomas Cobb, Patsey Bibb.  
