2 CONT ==concerns==
2 CONT '''detached as son from his alleged brother https://www.geni.com/people/Hugh-Montgomery-Sr/6000000223975045993 on February 21, 2026
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT alleged but unproven brother of https://www.geni.com/people/Hugh-Montgomery-of-Waxhaws/6000000011126683230
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Title also has been reported to be '''Captain'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of birth also have been (erroneously?) reported to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT * circa 1736 at County Down, Ulster, Ireland (now Northern Ireland) <attested on the cited WikiTree record, conflicts with his DAR ancestor record>
2 CONT * 1747 in Lancaster County, South Carolina <unattested, conflicts with his DAR ancestor record>
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death also have been (erroneously?) reported to be January 1, 1808 at Jefferson, Franklin County, Georgia, United States <attested on the cited WikiTree record, conflicts with his DAR ancestor record>.
2 CONT
