2 CONT aprx2004-2007) of Adventurers of Purse and Person by John Frederick Dorman;
1 NOTE Amy is named in the 1818 will of her husband, probated 1819; see Will Book C:
2 CONT   24, Edgefield Dist., SC. She was probably NOT born 13 Apr 1757.
2 CONT !BIRTH: etc: For documentation see Warren L. Forsythe, "Resolving Conflict
2 CONT between Records: A Spurious Moseley Bible," National Genealogical Society
2 CONT Quarterly  84  No.3 (Sept  1996): 182-199;
2 CONT A Joseph Collier, probably this one, had 6 whites in 1782 census; Knorr,
2 CONT Marriage... Charlotte Co., 17; Thomas W. Jones, Fairfax, Va. to author, June
2 CONT  1994: Joseph Collier's mother may be wrong in Elizabeth Hogg Ironmonger,
2 CONT Ironmonger and Connections: Updated, (Seaford, Va.: By the author, 1972), 118.
2 CONT  I added Sep 1992 only one of their children to my PAF file from Ancestral File
2 CONT printout of 26 Nov 1991 Ellensburg FHC, although there were many other
2 CONT children, I did not add them; Tom Jones (direct descendant of Amey) 11 Aug
2 CONT 1996 phone call: named in husband's will Edgefield Dist, SC, Will BK C, page
2 CONT 24: written 26 Dec 1818 probated 10 Feb 1819.
2 CONT Thomas W. Jones, 9232 Arlington Blvd, Fairfax, VA 22031 (from Ed Dolan '93).
