2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Iremonger-24
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: The only information on the children of Francis Ironmonger in Magna Carta Ancestry (#Richardson) is that he had two daughters, wives of John Collier and George Major. Additional support is needed for the profiles of Jane and
2 CONC  Elizabeth that I attached as his daughters. Additional support is also needed for his wife. Richardson says she is "unidentified"; she is named as Elizabeth in Descendants of Mordacai Cooke (p 26, #Stubbs), but her maiden name is
2 CONC  not given. ~Liz Shifflett, September 17, 2015
2 CONT
