2 CONT Anne ‘Nancy’ Collier is my/our 9th cousin 8 times removed.Janet Milburn 8/6/22
2 CONT She is also Oprah Winfrey's ancestor
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.familycentral.net/index/person_popup.cfm?ref1=6032:3643&mode=ped<br/>
2 CONT John Collier md. 6 Oct 1713 Virginia
2 CONT   Children
2 CONT * 1.  Thomas Collier b. 1 Dec 1714
2 CONT * 2.  Francis Collier b. 1716
2 CONT * 3.  Henry Isham Collier b. 30 Jun 1718
2 CONT * 4.  Cornelius Collier b. 16 Nov 1720
2 CONT * 5.  Mary Collier b. 14 Jan 1722
2 CONT * 6.  William Collier b. 10 Feb 1724
2 CONT * 7.  James Collier b. 26 May 1726
2 CONT * 8.  Eppes Collier b. 30 Apr 1728
2 CONT * 9.  Benjamin Collier b. 1 Jan 1730
2 CONT * 10.  Living
2 CONT * 11.  Frances Collier b. 31 Mar 1735
2 CONT * 12.  Judith Collier b. 1737
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Collier-1368
2 CONT
2 CONT John Collier was born in 1685 and passed away in 1735.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT John, son of Charles and Mary (Eyers) Collier, was born 3 March 1685.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT The Family Bible of Charles Collier records three marriages for John Collier:[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT * on 31 December 1704, John Collier and Elizabeth Ballard, dau. of Col. Thomas Ballard
2 CONT * on 3 February 1706, John Collier and Mrs. Elizabeth Gaines, dau. of Francis Ironmonger, Esq.
2 CONT * on 6 October 1713, John Collier and Anne Eppes, dau. of Col. Francis Eppes
2 CONT
2 CONT The Bible records the following births:[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT * John, son of John and Elizabeth Collier, born 28 February 1707
2 CONT * Elizabeth, son of John and Elizabeth Collier, born 3 April 1709
2 CONT * Thomas, son of John and Anne Collier, born 1 December 1714
2 CONT * Francis, son of John and Anne Collier, born 30 September 1716
2 CONT * Henry Isham Collier, son of John and Anne Collier, born 30 June 1718
2 CONT * Cornelius Collier, son of John and Anne Collier, born 16 November 1720
2 CONT * Mary Collier, daughter of John and Anne Collier, born 14 January 1723
2 CONT * William Collier, son of John and Anne Collier, born 10 February 1724
2 CONT * James Collier, son of John and Anne Collier, born 26 May 1726
2 CONT * Eppes Collier, son of John and Anne Collier, 30 April 1728
2 CONT * Benjamin Collier, son of John and Anne Collier, born 1 January 1730
2 CONT * Frances Collier, daughter of John and Anne Collier, born 31 March 1735
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Disputed Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Eppes-65
2 CONT
2 CONT Uncertain Family: Although attached as a daughter of Francis Eppes and his wife Anne Isham, Anne's profile noted that there are no sources, no support for a daughter of theirs named Nancy Ann (or Ann Nancy) who married a Meredith 
2 CONC (or a Collier).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p3969.htm#i119215
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy Ann Eppes1
2 CONT
2 CONT F, b. 3 February 1695, d. 1 November 1765
2 CONT
2 CONT Father Francis Eppes III Col.1 b. 1659, d. Jan 1718/19 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother Anne Isham1 b. c 1665, d. 1718 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy Ann Eppes was born on 3 February 1695 at King and Queen, VA.1 She married John Collier, son of Charles Collier and Mary Eyers, on 6 October 1713 at Wyanoke, Charles City, VA.1 Nancy Ann Eppes died on 1 November 1765 at age 7
2 CONC 0.1
2 CONT
