1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah Henry [Collier] Cole.  In all the records her middle name is Henry.  Sarah father, James mother was Sarah and his father was Alexander Collier.  Alexander served in the Virginia Militia with many men with the
2 CONC  last name of Henry [they all were in the same county.   I truly believe that Sarah Henry was name after her fathers mother.  I have not been able to prove this - too many Sarah's.
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
