2 CONC y-cole
2 CONT Sarah Collier married John Cole 4 November 1825 in Gallatin County, Kentucky.
2 CONT
2 CONT When the Foultz Cemetery was abandoned a family member is said to have removed Sarah's and John's tombstones and placed them in the Fillmore Cemetery.
