2 CONC years after they parted, when he became first Ohio Countian tried for murder 1809. Smeathers lived near the Yellow Banks (the present Owensboro) which territory then in Ohio County. In defense of his home and sister Mollie, he was
2 CONC  forced to kill a drunken flatboatman whose craft tied up nearby while the marauding crew threatened the property, lives and honor of the neighboring settlers. Promptly giving himself up to the officers of the law, William was tri
2 CONC ed at the April 1809 term of the Ohio Circuit Court, before the eccentric but respected Judge Henry P Broadnax. The celebrated Joseph Hamilton Daveiss, for whom Daviess County was named, volunteered to defend his friend, Smeathers
2 CONC , who was acquitted." "Col Joseph Daviess was US Attorney for Ky & had 36,000ac around PANTHER CREEK & OHIO RIVER & WM SMEATHERS did the survey for him." "WM SMEATHERS & BENJAMIN DUNCAN were appointed Land Commissioners to settle 
