2 CONC ences. They then settled in Berks Co Pa where he died 1760 leaving a will naming all his 10 children, 7 sons and 3 daus. More likely Pappy's parents are Jacob Smethers and lst wife Anna Margaretha, bur Laurel Cem Pennsylvania unde
2 CONC r auspics of being RW Patriot. Jacob Smethers and lst wife Anna Margaretha had at lest 11 children before she died after 1782. Pappy was probably their 2nd child born. [[this old story folks KEEP circulating has NO truth to it wha
2 CONC tsoever so is debunked!>Smithers was born on the border of Virginia near the Holston River, His father was killed by Indians when "Bill " was only twelve years old, and his mother died shortly afterwards. Before dawn on the day fo
2 CONC llowing his mother's burial he went and stood by the graves of his parents and lifting his hand to heaven he made a vow to devote his life to killing Indians. He fullfilled his vow at every opportunity. He was with Issac Shelby in
2 CONC  the battle of King's Mountain.]]
