2 CONT Mary and Henry Married 14 MAY 1812 in her Aunt Jane Smeathers Grass home, Spencer Co Ind Gentryville Ind by Rev John Wilkinson Gentryville, Indiana. Jane married Judge Daniel Grass of Spencer Co Ind.
2 CONT
