2 CONC hn Blankinship. Michael Tracy & Andrew Buckhannon were the adjoiners.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death aft 1814 - Barren County, Kentucky
2 CONT
2 CONT children of John Roberds and Sarah Williamson:
2 CONT
2 CONT Esther, Lydia, Rebekah, Thomas, John Jr., Sarah, and Asenath.
