1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Moses Perkins LEE was born on Jul 22 1818 in Pulaski, Giles County, Tennessee. He died on Dec 6 1897 in Grayson County, Texas. He was a in Cabinet Maker. He was buried in Washburn Cemetery, Grayson County, Texas. H
2 CONC e served in the military in Civil War: Company A, 2nd Battalion (Harris). He Rank in Rank: Private. He has reference number 152. He was married to Alpha Omega CAIN on Dec 23 1847 in Aberdeen, Monroe County, Mississippi.
2 CONT * '''Residence''': Pontotoc, Mississippi, United States - 1880
