2 CONT
2 CONT John Harrison Bailey, whose wife was Mary, left a Will which is on record in Union County dated December 31, 1801 and was probated March 9, 1802. He mentions William Winn and Thomas Winn in his will and also three children; a son 
2 CONC Harrison, a daughter Susannah who married William Lawson and a daughter Palatia who married Thomas Betterton. He also mentions Harrison and William Bailey, sons of Susannah.
