1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Tabitha Jane Allen Freeman (1838 - 1908)''', daughter of Lewis Allen (1813 - 1888) and Elizabeth Alexander (1819 - 1869), was born 7 October 1838 at Far West, Caldwell County, Missouri. She died at the age of 70
2 CONC  on 25 October 1908 at Snowflake, Navajo County, Arizona, and was buried at Snowflake Cemetery, Plot: Section-30, Space #1. Tabitha emigrated to Utah in 1862 with her parents. She married '''John Woodruff Freeman (1836 - 1905)'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children of John and Tabitha Freeman==
