1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Beulah Ann Allen''', daughter of Lewis and Elizabeth Allen, was born 24 May 1840 in Calloway County, Kentucky. In 1863 Beulah married [http://www.geni.com/people/Willis-Webb/6000000014341779809?through=600000001
2 CONC 4341975997 Willis Webb]. They had four children, [http://www.geni.com/people/Beulah-Webb/6000000014342189006?through=6000000014341779809 Beulah Ann], [http://www.geni.com/people/Laura-Webb/6000000014342189013?through=6000000014341
2 CONC 779809 Laura Elizabeth], [http://www.geni.com/people/Willis-Webb/6000000014342189020?through=6000000014341779809 Willis Abraham Webb], and [http://www.geni.com/people/Nancy-Webb/6000000014342189027?through=6000000014341779809 Nanc
2 CONC y Melissa Webb]. Beulah Ann Allen died in 1916, and was survived by her husband for five years. Both are buried in Emmett, Gem County, Idaho.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Marriage and Children==
2 CONT Beulah Ann Allen and [http://www.geni.com/people/Willis-Webb/6000000014341779809?through=6000000014341975997 Willis Webb], ( b. 29 September 1844 Chateaugay, Franklin, New York  - d. 21 October 1921Emmett, Gem County, Idaho) were 
2 CONC married in 1863 and had four children:
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Beulah-Webb/6000000014342189006?through=6000000014341779809 Beulah Ann Webb], born 7 July 1869 in Utah Territory, died 1 June 1942 in Emmett, Gem, Idaho, USA 
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Laura-Webb/6000000014342189013?through=6000000014341779809 Laura Elizabeth], born 6 November 1871 in Parawan, Iron County, Utah Territory, died 16 November 1905 in Emmett, Gem County, Idaho, USA 
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Willis-Webb/6000000014342189020?through=6000000014341779809 Willis Abraham Webb], born 26 July 1873 in Parawan, Iron County, Utah Territory, died 4 October 1935 in Emmett, Gem County, Idaho, USA 
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Nancy-Webb/6000000014342189027?through=6000000014341779809 Nancy Melissa Webb], born 9 June 1882 in Orderville, Kane County, Utah Territory, died 13 July 1954 in Emmett, Gem County, Idaho, USA 
2 CONT
