1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Richard Sims BROOKS is found in Madison Co. on the 1840 census. He was supposed to have owned a grocery store in Denmark. He was born in 1799 in Person Co., NC to Arthur BROOKS and Ann WOOD. He married 20 April 182
2 CONC 4 in Madison Co., AL to Vashti VALLIANT, dau. of Robert Spencer VALLIANT and Martha HURLOCK. They moved to TN in 1833. Children were: Dr. William Arthur Brooks, Rev. Calvin Hurlock Brooks, Martha Ann Brooks who m. Rev. John W. or 
2 CONC T. GOODE, Dr. John Denton Brooks, Minerva Anna Brooks who m. William P. TAYLOR and Joab SCALLORN, Rev. Robert Logan Brooks, James Jackson Brooks, Richard Preston Brooks, Louisa V. Brooks who m. Wood D. GRAY, Thomas Jefferson Brook
2 CONC s, and Temperance Brooks.
2 CONT
2 CONT Posted on Madison County Tennessee Queries
