1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He served in the Mexican War, as a Private in Capt. Welch's Company G, of Lt.Col. Gray's Battalion. 
2 CONT He enlisted at Fort Smith Arkansas 16 Jul 1846.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1853, He and his family went to California on his son Venable's second trip on the "California Trail". 
2 CONT Son Harvey was killed in an accident and buried beside the trail.
