1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah B. "Sally" Sanders was the third Wife Of Obediah Hooper Jr.  Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT William Sanders Hooper b. 11 Jan 1806
2 CONT
2 CONT Obediah B. Hooper b. 13 Jan 1807
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Betsy Polly Carter Hooper b. 17 Jul 1808
2 CONT
2 CONT Amelia Milly Hooper b. 12 Oct 1809
2 CONT
2 CONT James Hooper b. 06 Apr 1811
2 CONT
2 CONT She was also the Step Mother of Richard Hooper, who's daughter Mary Elizabeth married into the Sanders family when wedded to Sarah's Great Nephew William Hamilton Sanders. FAG Memorials exist for all of these people.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT Flora Hooper Collier's book " Hooper Genealogy A Southern Branch" page 104 shows her buried in this cemetery, but a search has failed to find a tomb stone for her. 
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCE:  Find A Grave.com
2 CONT
