2 CONT ** Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-469835265/john-day-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 4 2020, 21:54:49 UTC''
