1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I question the death date of this person. She is listed in the Bradley Co.,TN 1850 Federal Census along with her husband James Gibson (1777). The Elizabeth Glass that died in 1846 is not this person. Sh is from the
2 CONC  same linage, but is in Virginia and not the daughter of John Dorrance Glass who migrated to Greene Co., TN from Augusta County., VA and married James Gibson (bn 1777-VA) in Greene Co., TN in 1804.
