2 CONT Shows John 45, Kissiah 43, James 19, Nancy 13, Sarah A. 11, Margaret 11, Mary 9, John 4, Martha 1&lt;&gt;Lists John and Keriah as being born in TN&lt;&gt; 1850 TN Census, Bradley Co.&lt;
2 CONT Shows John Gipson 54, Kessiah 53, Mary 18, John 12, Martha 10&gt;Lists John and Keriah as being born in TN&lt;&gt;1860 AR Census, Conway Co., Union twp.&lt;
2 CONT Shows John and Kiriah being in Murray Co., GA in 1852&lt;&gt;Deed Books, Greene Co., TN, Vol 25, pg. 126&lt;&gt;1868 Conway County Census, Union twp., shows 1 horse, $75, one mule $15, 3 cattle $110, Total Value; $260.
2 CONT Arkansas Mortality Schedule&gt;Gipson, John, Conway Co., AR, age 65, male, Jan, born -TN, pneumonia; All of this fits the known data for John Gibson. He was born in 1805 so the death date and age at death match. also, he was born 
2 CONC in TN.
