1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nancy Sizemore was born 1786 in Westfield, Surry, North Carolina, USA, and died before 16 February 1833 in Delaware, Indiana, USA. She married Isaac Jackson 10 DEC 1808, Marriage bond at Stokes County NC, bondsman:
2 CONC  Thomas Bennett) son of Samuel Jackson Jr. and Hannah Gibson. He was born 1787 in Stokes, North Carolina, USA, and died 1835 in Delaware, Indiana, USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Nancy Sizemore and Isaac Jackson include: 
2 CONT * i.	Jehu Jackson was born DEC 1824 in Delaware, Indiana, USA, and died 1902 in Denton, Texas, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=boisejo1&id=I29201
2 CONT
2 CONT >”Isaac Jackson was living in Randolph Co., IN with a wife and five children (4 sons and 1 dau.) when the 1820 census was taken. He could have left North Carolina at the same time his two older brothers Jehu and James made the mov
2 CONC e. Both of them went first to Ohio, then to IN, settling in Randolph Co., IN”
2 CONT
