2 CONC lude Moses C. Cunningham, Samuel M. Houghton.
2 CONT * 1850:  United States Federal Census, District 1, Hopkins, Kentucky, farmer.  Neighbors include David & Loumira Farrar, Samuel & Elizabeth Howton,  Abijah & Nancy Ross.
