2 CONT Children 
2 CONT # Elizabeth Louisa (1837 – 1903).  Married 1) Sargeant Wisdom HUTCHESON. 2) Zemeriah Thomason.
2 CONT # Calvin C. (1840 – 1915).  Married Sarah Ann Logan.  Sheriff.
2 CONT # Jefferson A. (1842 – 1914). Married Christina Margaret Wyatt.
2 CONT # Martha A. (1845 – 1931).  Married Obediah Patterson Dibrell Mitchell.
2 CONT # William S. (1845 – 1893).  Married Tenia.
2 CONT # Peterson Monroe (1849 – 1932). Married Susan Mahala Ross (1848-1941) his cousin (daughter of William Ashburn Ross & Mahala Cunningham). Moved to Julietta, ID.
2 CONT # Hartwell Luther (1854 – 1916).  Married Izora Ann Loe.  Moved to TX.
2 CONT # Lucinda Emeline  (1855 – 1949). Married Alfred Bertram Thomason.  Moved to WA. 
2 CONT # Mahala T.  (1858 – 1919).  Married William Johnson.
2 CONT # Stephen Douglas  (1862 – 1947).  Married Martha Jane Norris. 
