0 @N6000000002217771677@ NOTE John Benjamin was in the Confederate Army.  He was in Cavalry Co. C under Capt. William Alexander.      
1 CONT John Nix's will is located at the courthouse in Miller Co., AR.  It states that his four daughters, Mattie McDonald, Lucindia Stevens, Frances Crow and Ellilah J. Tullis were to share in the estate.  The bulk of the estate was to 
1 CONC go to the children and grandchildren of his daughter Sallie Watson.  It listed Lizzie Watson dec., Paul B. and Jennie and Lizzie's children Clarence, Addie, and Paul.  William Watson was to get $1 and no more.  S.R. McDonald was t
1 CONC he sole executor of his will.
