1 CONC k in Goochland County.
1 CONT    His will was proved in Goochland County June 11, 1740.
1 CONT    Mourning Adams later lived in Albemarle County where she deeded personal property to her children in lieu of a will in 1765. In 1762 she deeded personal property to her son-in-law Charles Douglas.[ButterNU.ged]
