0 @N6000000002217781490@ NOTE The 1850 census lists his age as 22
1 CONT The 1860 census lists his age as 34
1 CONT The 1870 census lists his age as 40
1 CONT The 1880 census lists his age as
1 CONT
1 CONT Marrige record in Lafayette Co., AR 1852 lists his age as 25
1 CONT Marriage record in Lafayette Co., AR 1-31-1861 N.F. Jackson to E.>S. Hurt
1 CONT Marriage record in Lafayette Co., AR Nathan F. Jackson to Susan L. Roberts 5-31-1868
1 CONT
1 CONT On the 1850 Sevier Co., AR census Nathan Jackson age 22 born TN had a Martha age 15 born TN and a John Henderson age 12 born TN living with him. Don't know if this Martha is a wife or sister.  In 1860 Lafayette Co., AR he was livi
1 CONC ng by himself.  In 1870 Lafayette Co., AR census he had a Mary and James ages 16 and 14 living with him, probably from Margaret J. McCollum.
1 CONT
1 CONT I could not find a marriage record in Sevier Co., AR for Nathan Jackson to see if he was married to the Martha listed on the 1850 census record.
0 @N6000000002217771738@ NOTE Lucinda Stevens will stated that she was married to P.S. Stevens and that they had no children.  Charles P. and Gertrude McDonald were her sole executors.  It lists Ruth Knotts dec. $50. Her estate was to be shared between Angie P
1 CONC . Poe and Martha E. McDonald.  An addendum dated 5-3-1956 was added.  It said 1/2 interest in the mineral rights was sold to John McDonald and the other 1/2 share was to go to him at her death.
