1 CONT Burke Co., NC. Moved to Calloway Co., KY and died in Marshall Co., K
1 CONT before 1845), Moses (1785 in TN Moved to AR and died in
1 CONT Crawford Co on 11 Jul 1828), John A (1784 in TN Died 1860), Andrew
1 CONT Ray (23 Jan 1792 Summer Co., TN Died 28 Dec 1839), Matthew (5 Jul 179
1 CONT in Smith Co., TN Died 11 Jun 1865 (7), Mark (12 Mar 1796 in TN Was i
1 CONT War 1812. Died 5 Dec 1859), Allen (1790 Summer Co., TN Was in War 181
1 CONT and died c. 1816 Butler Co., KY), Margaret "Peggy" (c. 1800 Butler Co.,
1 CONT KY Died Nov 1855).
1 CONT Matthew enlisted York District 1776, SC., and Burke Co 1780, NC
1 CONT He was in (military ?) Washington Co., NC (3-4 years), Davidson Co.,
1 CONT TN (8-10 years), then in Logan (Butler) Co., KY (1796).
1 CONT Andrew Ray had a son, Calvin, who lived in Palma, KY  Calvin had a
1 CONT son, Andrew Joseph (Joe), who raised a family in Palma in a 2 story
1 CONT house (torn down) @ curve in the road (up on hill).
1 CONT 1.  Marshall Co., KY Genealogy Records
1 CONT 2.  Jacqueline L Baird, 3750 Whitland Ave., Nashville, TN 37205
